AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26889974") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "GPT-6 (OpenAI Codex), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:26889974") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4800295/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "However, the balance between improved survival and costs, in terms of toxicity, quality of life and financial, can be difficult.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000040> "A randomised trial cohort of patients with advanced colorectal cancer in the Continuous or Intermittent (COIN) trial, comparing uninterrupted oxaliplatin and fluoropyrimidine chemotherapy with planned treatment breaks to assess survival and treatment burden.")
