AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:33169150") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "GPT-6 (OpenAI Codex), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:36852012") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9960719/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The biobank is based on surplus EDTA whole blood from patients admitted to Danish hospitals in the Copenhagen area for diagnostic or treatment purposes who have samples drawn for blood type testing or red cell antibody screening.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000046> "A biobank of patients receiving hospital care in the Capital Region of Denmark, established at Rigshospitalet in Copenhagen in February 2009 and subsequently expanded to other hospitals, retaining leftover clinical blood samples to enable research on health and disease.")

