AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:12871360") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "GPT-6 (OpenAI Codex), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:12871360") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A12871360+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "However, the relationship between plasma concentrations of inflammatory and hemostatic markers and the severity of atherosclerosis is not yet well studied.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000048> "A cohort of men and women in the Danish Glostrup population examined at age 60 to investigate inflammatory, haemostatic and genetic correlates of atherosclerosis.")
