AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:22479191") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31784700") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:31784700") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7080768/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "These populations belong to the INGI (Italian Network of Genetic Isolates) network.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000105> "A network of Italian studies of genetically isolated populations, among them Val Borbera, Friuli Venezia Giulia, Carlantino and Cilento, combining genomic and phenotypic data to investigate genetic variation and complex traits.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:22479191") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31784700") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:31784700") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7080768/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "We characterised whole-genome sequences from isolated populations localised in three different geographical areas of Italy: North-West (Val Borbera - VBI), North-East (Friuli Venezia Giulia - FVG) and South-East (Carlantino - CAR); for which the presence of stratification [8, 11] and the different levels of isolation were demonstrated [12].") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000105> "A network of Italian studies of genetically isolated populations, among them Val Borbera, Friuli Venezia Giulia, Carlantino and Cilento, combining genomic and phenotypic data to investigate genetic variation and complex traits.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:22479191") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31784700") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:31784700") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A31784700+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "First, we defined a new Italian Genome Reference Panel (IGRP1.0) for imputation, which improved imputation accuracy, especially for rare variants, and we tested it by GWAS analysis on red blood traits.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000105> "A network of Italian studies of genetically isolated populations, among them Val Borbera, Friuli Venezia Giulia, Carlantino and Cilento, combining genomic and phenotypic data to investigate genetic variation and complex traits.")

