AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:24646526") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "GPT-6 (OpenAI Codex), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:24646526") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A24646526+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "To study the genetics of asthma, a familial collection was built in the Saguenay-Lac-Saint-Jean (SLSJ) region, which is localized in northeastern Quebec, Canada, and which is characterized by a young founder effect.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000149> "A cohort of families recruited through members with asthma in the founder population of Saguenay–Lac-Saint-Jean, Quebec, Canada, with respiratory, allergy and genetic measurements to investigate inherited determinants of asthma and related traits.")

