AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:36418382") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4056331/") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:25293721") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4351890/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The SAHLSIS is a case–control study on ischemic stroke before 70 years of age, the design of which has been described in detail before.25 Briefly, white patients who presented with first-ever or recurrent acute ischemic stroke before reaching the age of 70 years (n=844) were consecutively recruited between 1998 and 2008 at four stroke units in Western Sweden.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000150> "A case-control collection of patients with acute ischaemic stroke before the age of 70, recruited in Gothenburg, Sweden, from 1998, and matched population controls, with longitudinal patient follow-up to investigate stroke risk factors and outcomes.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:36418382") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4056331/") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:25293721") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4351890/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "White community-control subjects (n=668) from the same geographic area as the cases were randomly selected to match cases for age and sex.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000150> "A case-control collection of patients with acute ischaemic stroke before the age of 70, recruited in Gothenburg, Sweden, from 1998, and matched population controls, with longitudinal patient follow-up to investigate stroke risk factors and outcomes.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:36418382") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4056331/") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:36418382") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9684578/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "In brief, patients presenting with first-ever or recurrent acute ischemic stroke at age 18–69 years were recruited consecutively at the stroke unit at the Sahlgrenska University Hospital, Gothenburg, Sweden during 1998–2003.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000150> "A case-control collection of patients with acute ischaemic stroke before the age of 70, recruited in Gothenburg, Sweden, from 1998, and matched population controls, with longitudinal patient follow-up to investigate stroke risk factors and outcomes.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:36418382") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4056331/") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:36418382") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9684578/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "This study comprises participants in the longitudinal part of the Sahlgrenska Academy Study on Ischemic Stroke (SAHLSIS) and their matched controls.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000150> "A case-control collection of patients with acute ischaemic stroke before the age of 70, recruited in Gothenburg, Sweden, from 1998, and matched population controls, with longitudinal patient follow-up to investigate stroke risk factors and outcomes.")

# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000151> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000151>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://sardinia.nia.nih.gov/") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "GPT-6 (OpenAI Codex), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:16934002") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC1557782/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "We recruited and phenotyped 6,148 individuals, male and female, age 14 y and above (Figure 1A) from a cluster of four towns in the Lanusei Valley in the Ogliastra region of the Sardinian province of Nuoro.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000151> "A cohort of residents aged 14–102 at baseline from four towns in the Ogliastra region of Sardinia, Italy, established in 2001 for longitudinal investigation of genetic influences on ageing, cardiovascular risk factors, personality and other age-related traits.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://sardinia.nia.nih.gov/") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "GPT-6 (OpenAI Codex), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://sardinia.nia.nih.gov/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Regarding the course and mechanism of aging, the longitudinal study, now in its 22nd year, has focused on residents of the cluster of towns to collect longitudinal information on more than 800 age-related quantitative traits") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000151> "A cohort of residents aged 14–102 at baseline from four towns in the Ogliastra region of Sardinia, Italy, established in 2001 for longitudinal investigation of genetic influences on ageing, cardiovascular risk factors, personality and other age-related traits.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://sardinia.nia.nih.gov/") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "GPT-6 (OpenAI Codex), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://sardinia.nia.nih.gov/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The initial sample cohort included over 62% of the eligible population living in the region (age 14-102 years), and at least 96% of the initial cohort have all grandparents born in the same province.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000151> "A cohort of residents aged 14–102 at baseline from four towns in the Ogliastra region of Sardinia, Italy, established in 2001 for longitudinal investigation of genetic influences on ageing, cardiovascular risk factors, personality and other age-related traits.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://sardinia.nia.nih.gov/") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "GPT-6 (OpenAI Codex), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://sardinia.nia.nih.gov/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "We quote directly from the rationale and background for the initiation of the study in 2001, which also applies to follow-up studies in course: Rationale: To identify genetic bases for prominent age-associated changes, including, for example, cardiovascular risk factors and determinants of personality traits, in a founder population.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000151> "A cohort of residents aged 14–102 at baseline from four towns in the Ogliastra region of Sardinia, Italy, established in 2001 for longitudinal investigation of genetic influences on ageing, cardiovascular risk factors, personality and other age-related traits.")

