AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:37783704") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "GPT-6 (OpenAI Codex), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:37783704") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10545678/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "BCC non-Hispanic White 1818 873 (48.0%)") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000183> "A case-control collection of self-identified non-Hispanic White participants with colorectal cancer and comparison participants, contributing the Basque-colon validation sample for evaluation of polygenic prediction of colorectal cancer risk.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:37783704") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "GPT-6 (OpenAI Codex), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:37783704") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10545678/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Racial and ethnic identification in these studies were self-reported.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000183> "A case-control collection of self-identified non-Hispanic White participants with colorectal cancer and comparison participants, contributing the Basque-colon validation sample for evaluation of polygenic prediction of colorectal cancer risk.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:37783704") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "GPT-6 (OpenAI Codex), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:37783704") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10545678/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "We evaluated the performance of each of the developed PRS in the Genetic Epidemiology Research on Adult Health and Aging Cohort (GERA) cohort; Minority GWAS Japanese study (MG-JPN)39; Minority GWAS African American study (MG-AA)40; Hispanic Colorectal Cancer Study (HCCS)41; Multiethnic Cohort study (MEC); Cancer Prevention Study II (CPSII)42; Basque-colon cohort (BCC); and Electronic Medical Records and Genomics (eMERGE) study.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000183> "A case-control collection of self-identified non-Hispanic White participants with colorectal cancer and comparison participants, contributing the Basque-colon validation sample for evaluation of polygenic prediction of colorectal cancer risk.")

