AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:25919442") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "GPT-6 (OpenAI Codex), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:25919442") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A25919442+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "To examine relationships between modifiable midlife factors, aging, and physical and cognitive function (independent aging) and survival in very old age.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000194> "A cohort of men aged about 50 years in Uppsala, Sweden, examined during 1970–1974 and followed prospectively to investigate cardiovascular and lifestyle risk factors, survival and functional independence in old age.")
