AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://ega-archive.org/studies/EGAS00001004434") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://ega-archive.org/studies/EGAS00001004434") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Here, we present the first 391 Egyptian healthy volunteers (EHVols) recruited to establish a pilot phenotyped control cohort.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000245> "A cohort of Egyptian healthy volunteers free of cardiovascular disease, of whom 391 were recruited as a pilot phenotyped control cohort with cardiac MRI and targeted sequencing of inherited cardiac condition genes, to define the genetic landscape of an understudied North African population.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://ega-archive.org/studies/EGAS00001004434") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://ega-archive.org/studies/EGAS00001004434") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The ECCO-GEN project aims at defining the genetic landscape of an understudied population and providing individual-level genetic and phenotypic data to support future studies in CVD and population genetics.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000245> "A cohort of Egyptian healthy volunteers free of cardiovascular disease, of whom 391 were recruited as a pilot phenotyped control cohort with cardiac MRI and targeted sequencing of inherited cardiac condition genes, to define the genetic landscape of an understudied North African population.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://ega-archive.org/studies/EGAS00001004434") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://ega-archive.org/studies/EGAS00001004434") Annotation(rdfs:comment "To address this, the Egyptian Collaborative Cardiac Genomics (ECCO-GEN) Project launched a study comprising 1000 individuals free of cardiovascular disease (CVD).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000245> "A cohort of Egyptian healthy volunteers free of cardiovascular disease, of whom 391 were recruited as a pilot phenotyped control cohort with cardiac MRI and targeted sequencing of inherited cardiac condition genes, to define the genetic landscape of an understudied North African population.")

