AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:41795035") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:41795035") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13109230/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "We validated our results in two independent type 1 diabetes case–control cohorts (Children's Hospital of Philadelphia, Center for Applied Genomics [CHOP-CAG] and Genetic Risk Assessment for Chinese Eaglet-T1D [GRACE]) and two population-based cohorts (All of Us and UK Biobank).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000462> "A case–control collection of children with type 1 diabetes and controls from multiple paediatric centres in China, used to validate polygenic risk scores for type 1 diabetes in an East Asian population.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:41795035") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:41795035") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13109230/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "in a Chinese case–control cohort across multiple paediatric centres named Genetic Risk Assessment for Chinese Eaglet-T1D (GRACE, N=597; Ncases=294; Ncontrols=303).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000462> "A case–control collection of children with type 1 diabetes and controls from multiple paediatric centres in China, used to validate polygenic risk scores for type 1 diabetes in an East Asian population.")
