AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41398-025-03418-z/MediaObjects/41398_2025_3418_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5714283/fullTextXML") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41398-025-03418-z/MediaObjects/41398_2025_3418_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The genome wide association study (GWAS) non-overlapping samples are composed of a case- control study (WHI Genomics and Randomized Trials Network – GARNET, which included all coronary heart disease, stroke, venous thromboembolic events and selected diabetes cases that happened during the active intervention phase in the WHI HT clinical trials and aged matched controls)") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000505> "A nested case-control genome-wide association sub-study of the Women's Health Initiative hormone therapy trials, comprising the coronary heart disease, stroke, venous thromboembolism and selected diabetes cases that arose during the active intervention phase and age-matched controls, genotyped under the NHGRI Genomics and Randomized Trials Network (GARNET).")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41398-025-03418-z/MediaObjects/41398_2025_3418_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5714283/fullTextXML") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/study.cgi?study_id=phs000315.v8.p3") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Case selection of adjudicated phenotypes of interest included coronary heart disease, stroke, venous thrombosis, and incident diabetes cases that occurred during the active phase of the Hormone Trial (HT).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000505> "A nested case-control genome-wide association sub-study of the Women's Health Initiative hormone therapy trials, comprising the coronary heart disease, stroke, venous thromboembolism and selected diabetes cases that arose during the active intervention phase and age-matched controls, genotyped under the NHGRI Genomics and Randomized Trials Network (GARNET).")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41398-025-03418-z/MediaObjects/41398_2025_3418_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5714283/fullTextXML") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/study.cgi?study_id=phs000315.v8.p3") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Of the approximately 27,000 women who participated in the HT trial, 4,894 were genotyped on the Illumina Omni-Quad as part of WHI GARNET, a genome-wide association study (GWAS) to identify genetic components involved in differential responses from the HT trial.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000505> "A nested case-control genome-wide association sub-study of the Women's Health Initiative hormone therapy trials, comprising the coronary heart disease, stroke, venous thromboembolism and selected diabetes cases that arose during the active intervention phase and age-matched controls, genotyped under the NHGRI Genomics and Randomized Trials Network (GARNET).")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41398-025-03418-z/MediaObjects/41398_2025_3418_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5714283/fullTextXML") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/study.cgi?study_id=phs000315.v8.p3") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Participants were selected as a nested case-control sample of coronary heart disease, stroke, venous thrombosis, and incident diabetes events from the parent WHI Hormone Trial.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000505> "A nested case-control genome-wide association sub-study of the Women's Health Initiative hormone therapy trials, comprising the coronary heart disease, stroke, venous thromboembolism and selected diabetes cases that arose during the active intervention phase and age-matched controls, genotyped under the NHGRI Genomics and Randomized Trials Network (GARNET).")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41398-025-03418-z/MediaObjects/41398_2025_3418_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5714283/fullTextXML") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/study.cgi?study_id=phs000315.v8.p3") Annotation(rdfs:comment "This study is part of the Genomics and Randomized Trials Network (GARNET, http://www.garnetstudy.org) funded by the National Human Genome Research Institute (NHGRI).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000505> "A nested case-control genome-wide association sub-study of the Women's Health Initiative hormone therapy trials, comprising the coronary heart disease, stroke, venous thromboembolism and selected diabetes cases that arose during the active intervention phase and age-matched controls, genotyped under the NHGRI Genomics and Randomized Trials Network (GARNET).")

