AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:37308787") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:39948438") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41588-026-02689-6") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The MCPS is a longstanding scientific collaboration between researchers at the National Autonomous University of Mexico and University of Oxford") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000520> "A prospective cohort of more than 150,000 adults aged 35 and over, recruited in 1998-2004 from the contiguous urban districts of Coyoacán and Iztapalapa in Mexico City with the University of Oxford, and followed to investigate known and new risk factors for mortality in people of Mexican descent; its participants have exome and genome-wide genetic data.")

