# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000587> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000587>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21717116") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32641421") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:21717116") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC4222062") Annotation(rdfs:comment "As part of the wider InterAct project, consortium partners have established a case-cohort study of incident type 2 diabetes (InterAct Study) based on cases occurring in European Prospective Investigation into Cancer and Nutrition (EPIC) cohorts between 1991 and 2007 in 8 of 10 EPIC countries participating in InterAct.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000587> "A case-cohort study nested in the European Prospective Investigation into Cancer and Nutrition, comprising 12,403 verified incident cases of type 2 diabetes occurring in 1991-2007 among 340,234 eligible EPIC participants in eight European countries and a centre-stratified random subcohort of 16,154, assembled by the InterAct consortium to study how genes and lifestyle, especially diet and physical activity, interact in the risk of type 2 diabetes.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21717116") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32641421") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:21717116") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A21717116+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "A total of 12,403 verified incident cases of type 2 diabetes occurred during 3.99 million person-years of follow-up of 340,234 EPIC participants eligible for InterAct.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000587> "A case-cohort study nested in the European Prospective Investigation into Cancer and Nutrition, comprising 12,403 verified incident cases of type 2 diabetes occurring in 1991-2007 among 340,234 eligible EPIC participants in eight European countries and a centre-stratified random subcohort of 16,154, assembled by the InterAct consortium to study how genes and lifestyle, especially diet and physical activity, interact in the risk of type 2 diabetes.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21717116") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32641421") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:21717116") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A21717116+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Incident cases of type 2 diabetes occurring in European Prospective Investigation into Cancer and Nutrition (EPIC) cohorts between 1991 and 2007 from eight of the ten EPIC countries were ascertained and verified.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000587> "A case-cohort study nested in the European Prospective Investigation into Cancer and Nutrition, comprising 12,403 verified incident cases of type 2 diabetes occurring in 1991-2007 among 340,234 eligible EPIC participants in eight European countries and a centre-stratified random subcohort of 16,154, assembled by the InterAct consortium to study how genes and lifestyle, especially diet and physical activity, interact in the risk of type 2 diabetes.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21717116") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32641421") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:21717116") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A21717116+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "This case-cohort study aims to investigate how genetic and potentially modifiable lifestyle and behavioural factors, particularly diet and physical activity, interact in their influence on the risk of developing type 2 diabetes.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000587> "A case-cohort study nested in the European Prospective Investigation into Cancer and Nutrition, comprising 12,403 verified incident cases of type 2 diabetes occurring in 1991-2007 among 340,234 eligible EPIC participants in eight European countries and a centre-stratified random subcohort of 16,154, assembled by the InterAct consortium to study how genes and lifestyle, especially diet and physical activity, interact in the risk of type 2 diabetes.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21717116") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32641421") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:21717116") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A21717116+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "We defined a centre-stratified subcohort of 16,154 individuals for comparative analyses.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000587> "A case-cohort study nested in the European Prospective Investigation into Cancer and Nutrition, comprising 12,403 verified incident cases of type 2 diabetes occurring in 1991-2007 among 340,234 eligible EPIC participants in eight European countries and a centre-stratified random subcohort of 16,154, assembled by the InterAct consortium to study how genes and lifestyle, especially diet and physical activity, interact in the risk of type 2 diabetes.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21717116") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32641421") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:32641421") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7341350/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The EPIC-InterAct study is a prospective case-cohort study, nested within the European EPIC study.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000587> "A case-cohort study nested in the European Prospective Investigation into Cancer and Nutrition, comprising 12,403 verified incident cases of type 2 diabetes occurring in 1991-2007 among 340,234 eligible EPIC participants in eight European countries and a centre-stratified random subcohort of 16,154, assembled by the InterAct consortium to study how genes and lifestyle, especially diet and physical activity, interact in the risk of type 2 diabetes.")

