AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:16167509") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:36267918") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:9151378") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:16167509") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A16167509+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "A bio bank for DNA and blood markers was established.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000589> "A population-based cohort of 9,651 adults examined in 1991 in eight areas representing the range of environmental and socio-demographic conditions in Switzerland, reassessed in 2001-2003 and 2010 with spirometry, Holter ECG and a DNA and blood biobank, set up to study the long-term effects of air pollution on lung function and respiratory and cardiovascular health.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:16167509") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:36267918") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:9151378") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:16167509") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A16167509+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Of 9651 participants examined in 1991, 8715 could be traced for the cohort study and 283 died.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000589> "A population-based cohort of 9,651 adults examined in 1991 in eight areas representing the range of environmental and socio-demographic conditions in Switzerland, reassessed in 2001-2003 and 2010 with spirometry, Holter ECG and a DNA and blood biobank, set up to study the long-term effects of air pollution on lung function and respiratory and cardiovascular health.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:16167509") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:36267918") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:9151378") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:16167509") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A16167509+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The health assessment at recruitment (1991) and at the first reassessment (2001-3) consisted of an interview about respiratory health, occupational and other exposures, spirometry, a methacholine bronchial challenge test, end-expiratory carbon monoxide (CO) measurement and measurement for atopy.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000589> "A population-based cohort of 9,651 adults examined in 1991 in eight areas representing the range of environmental and socio-demographic conditions in Switzerland, reassessed in 2001-2003 and 2010 with spirometry, Holter ECG and a DNA and blood biobank, set up to study the long-term effects of air pollution on lung function and respiratory and cardiovascular health.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:16167509") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:36267918") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:9151378") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:36267918") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9576575/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "It was initiated in 1991 (SAPALDIA 1) with a follow-up assessment in 2002 (SAPALDIA 2) and 2010 (SAPALDIA3).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000589> "A population-based cohort of 9,651 adults examined in 1991 in eight areas representing the range of environmental and socio-demographic conditions in Switzerland, reassessed in 2001-2003 and 2010 with spirometry, Holter ECG and a DNA and blood biobank, set up to study the long-term effects of air pollution on lung function and respiratory and cardiovascular health.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:16167509") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:36267918") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:9151378") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:36267918") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9576575/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Swiss Cohort Study on Air Pollution And Lung And Heart Disease In Adults (SAPALDIA) is a population-based multi-center study in eight geographic areas representing the range of environmental, meteorological and socio-demographic conditions in Switzerland") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000589> "A population-based cohort of 9,651 adults examined in 1991 in eight areas representing the range of environmental and socio-demographic conditions in Switzerland, reassessed in 2001-2003 and 2010 with spirometry, Holter ECG and a DNA and blood biobank, set up to study the long-term effects of air pollution on lung function and respiratory and cardiovascular health.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:16167509") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:36267918") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:9151378") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:36267918") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9576575/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "This study has specifically been designed to investigate longitudinally lung function, respiratory and cardiovascular health; to study and identify the associations of these health indicators with individual long term exposure to air pollution, other toxic inhalants, lifestyle and molecular factors.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000589> "A population-based cohort of 9,651 adults examined in 1991 in eight areas representing the range of environmental and socio-demographic conditions in Switzerland, reassessed in 2001-2003 and 2010 with spirometry, Holter ECG and a DNA and blood biobank, set up to study the long-term effects of air pollution on lung function and respiratory and cardiovascular health.")

