# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000605> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000605>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29547889") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31831580") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:29547889") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6124620/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "All children (n = 1536) born on the Isle of Wight between 1 January 1989 and 28 February 1990 were enrolled, with 1456 consenting for long-term follow-up.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000605> "A whole-population birth cohort of the children born on the Isle of Wight, England, between 1 January 1989 and 28 February 1990, of whom 1,456 were enrolled for long-term follow-up and assessed at 1, 2, 4, 10, 18 and 26 years, to study the prevalence, natural history and risk and protective factors of asthma and allergic diseases from infancy into adulthood.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29547889") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31831580") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:29547889") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6124620/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "IOWBC is a whole-population prospective, observational study investigating prevalence, natural history and risk and protective factors for the development of asthma and allergic diseases.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000605> "A whole-population birth cohort of the children born on the Isle of Wight, England, between 1 January 1989 and 28 February 1990, of whom 1,456 were enrolled for long-term follow-up and assessed at 1, 2, 4, 10, 18 and 26 years, to study the prevalence, natural history and risk and protective factors of asthma and allergic diseases from infancy into adulthood.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29547889") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31831580") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:29547889") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6124620/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The Isle of Wight is an island off the south coast of England, with a resident population of approximately 130 000.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000605> "A whole-population birth cohort of the children born on the Isle of Wight, England, between 1 January 1989 and 28 February 1990, of whom 1,456 were enrolled for long-term follow-up and assessed at 1, 2, 4, 10, 18 and 26 years, to study the prevalence, natural history and risk and protective factors of asthma and allergic diseases from infancy into adulthood.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29547889") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31831580") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:29547889") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6124620/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The children in the IOWBC have been seen on six occasions over the course of 26 years, at 1, 2, 4, 10, 18 and 26 years (Table 1).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000605> "A whole-population birth cohort of the children born on the Isle of Wight, England, between 1 January 1989 and 28 February 1990, of whom 1,456 were enrolled for long-term follow-up and assessed at 1, 2, 4, 10, 18 and 26 years, to study the prevalence, natural history and risk and protective factors of asthma and allergic diseases from infancy into adulthood.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29547889") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31831580") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:29547889") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6124620/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The focus of the IOWBC is to: assess prevalence of allergic sensitization and clinical allergic manifestations in an unselected population during childhood and early adult life; explore the natural history of allergic sensitization and clinical allergic manifestations from infancy to early adult life;") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000605> "A whole-population birth cohort of the children born on the Isle of Wight, England, between 1 January 1989 and 28 February 1990, of whom 1,456 were enrolled for long-term follow-up and assessed at 1, 2, 4, 10, 18 and 26 years, to study the prevalence, natural history and risk and protective factors of asthma and allergic diseases from infancy into adulthood.")

# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000606> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000606>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21647700") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:6637993") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4897940/fullTextXML") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8394596/fullTextXML") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8990175/supplementaryFiles") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:6637993") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A6637993+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "To assess the prevalence and morbidity of noninsulin-dependent diabetes mellitus among Mexican Americans, 14% of the Starr County, Texas, population (97% Mexican-American) was randomly sampled.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000606> "A long-running programme of studies of type 2 diabetes and related chronic disease among Mexican Americans in Starr County, Texas, on the Texas-Mexico border, run from the University of Texas Health Science Center at Houston, which include a random sample of 14% of the county's population reported in 1983, type 2 diabetes case-control collections in 1987-2006, and a household survey of randomly selected blocks with examinations in 2002-2006 and re-examinations in 2010-2014, to study the prevalence, risk factors, genetics and complications of diabetes.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21647700") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:6637993") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4897940/fullTextXML") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8394596/fullTextXML") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8990175/supplementaryFiles") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6467367/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The Starr County Health Studies (Starr) have been examining the risk factors of diabetes in a predominantly Mexican-American border county in Texas since 1981 [96,97].") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000606> "A long-running programme of studies of type 2 diabetes and related chronic disease among Mexican Americans in Starr County, Texas, on the Texas-Mexico border, run from the University of Texas Health Science Center at Houston, which include a random sample of 14% of the county's population reported in 1983, type 2 diabetes case-control collections in 1987-2006, and a household survey of randomly selected blocks with examinations in 2002-2006 and re-examinations in 2010-2014, to study the prevalence, risk factors, genetics and complications of diabetes.")
