AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:25987846") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://ars.els-cdn.com/content/image/1-s2.0-S2210776226000724-mmc1.docx") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://ars.els-cdn.com/content/image/1-s2.0-S2210776226000724-mmc1.docx") Annotation(rdfs:comment "For the current study, information on 393 and 401 patients with NMIBC collected in two different batches (GUB-1 and GUB-2, respectively) was available.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000683> "A biobank set up in 2008 at Princess Margaret Hospital, Toronto, Canada, holding biospecimens, including blood for DNA extraction, from patients attending its Genito-Urinary Oncology clinics for the suspicion, diagnosis or treatment of prostate, kidney, bladder, testis or penile tumours, whose non-muscle invasive bladder cancer patients, in two batches (GUB-1 and GUB-2), were used in genetic studies of recurrence and progression.")
