AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23505323") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23505323") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC3917605/unicode") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Here we report the first Mexican GWA study for lipids in Mexican hypertriglyceridemia cases and controls.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000734> "A case-control collection of Mexican adults with hypertriglyceridaemia and normotriglyceridaemic controls recruited at the Instituto Nacional de Ciencias Médicas y Nutrición Salvador Zubirán in Mexico City, Mexico, for the first genome-wide association study of lipids in Mexicans.")
