AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32994253") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:32994253") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A32994253+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "At baseline, we recorded socio-demographic, lifestyle, anthropometric, biochemical and clinical data of the participants.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000761> "A prospective population-based cohort of adults aged 35–64 years recruited in 2007 by age-stratified random sampling in the semi-urban Ragama Medical Officer of Health area of Gampaha district, Sri Lanka, with baseline socio-demographic, lifestyle, anthropometric, biochemical and clinical data and follow-up of mortality and its predictors.")
