# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000762> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000762>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31401553") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:31401553") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://doi.org/10.1136/bjophthalmol-2019-314760") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Building on SCES-1, SCES-2 will be one of the few longitudinal population-based eye studies to report incidence, progression, and risk factors of major age-related eye diseases.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000762> "A population-based cohort of Chinese adults in Singapore examined at baseline in 2009–2011 (SCES-1) and invited for a 6-year follow-up in 2015–2017 (SCES-2) with standardised ocular and systemic examinations and questionnaires, to study the prevalence, incidence, progression and risk factors of age-related eye diseases.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31401553") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:31401553") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://doi.org/10.1136/bjophthalmol-2019-314760") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The prevalence rates for glaucoma, age related macular degeneration, and diabetic retinopathy (among diabetics) were 3.2%, 6.8%, 26.2%, respectively.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000762> "A population-based cohort of Chinese adults in Singapore examined at baseline in 2009–2011 (SCES-1) and invited for a 6-year follow-up in 2015–2017 (SCES-2) with standardised ocular and systemic examinations and questionnaires, to study the prevalence, incidence, progression and risk factors of age-related eye diseases.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31401553") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:31401553") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A31401553+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "3353 Chinese adults who participated in the baseline SCES-1 (2009-2011) were invited for the 6-year follow-up SCES-2 (2015-2017).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000762> "A population-based cohort of Chinese adults in Singapore examined at baseline in 2009–2011 (SCES-1) and invited for a 6-year follow-up in 2015–2017 (SCES-2) with standardised ocular and systemic examinations and questionnaires, to study the prevalence, incidence, progression and risk factors of age-related eye diseases.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31401553") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:31401553") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A31401553+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Examination procedures for SCES-2 included standardised ocular, systemic examinations and questionnaires identical to SCES-1.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000762> "A population-based cohort of Chinese adults in Singapore examined at baseline in 2009–2011 (SCES-1) and invited for a 6-year follow-up in 2015–2017 (SCES-2) with standardised ocular and systemic examinations and questionnaires, to study the prevalence, incidence, progression and risk factors of age-related eye diseases.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31401553") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:31401553") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A31401553+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "We herein report the key findings from the baseline Singapore Chinese Eye Study (SCES-1), and describe the rationale and methodology of the 6-year follow-up study (SCES-2).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000762> "A population-based cohort of Chinese adults in Singapore examined at baseline in 2009–2011 (SCES-1) and invited for a 6-year follow-up in 2015–2017 (SCES-2) with standardised ocular and systemic examinations and questionnaires, to study the prevalence, incidence, progression and risk factors of age-related eye diseases.")
