AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28472538") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23084122") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A23084122+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "A total of 3400 Indians (75.6% response rate) aged 40 to 84 years in Singapore.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000764> "A population-based cohort of adults of Indian ethnicity in Singapore, examined at baseline in 2007–2009 and again in 2013–2015 (SINDI-2), to study diabetic retinopathy and other major age-related eye diseases and the impact of migration, comparing first-generation immigrants with Singapore-born second-generation participants.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28472538") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:28472538") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A28472538+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "A total of 2200 adults had participated in baseline SINDI (2007-2009, mean age [range] = 57.8 [42.7-84.1] years) and SINDI-2 (2013-2015, 56.5 [48.4-90.2] years).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000764> "A population-based cohort of adults of Indian ethnicity in Singapore, examined at baseline in 2007–2009 and again in 2013–2015 (SINDI-2), to study diabetic retinopathy and other major age-related eye diseases and the impact of migration, comparing first-generation immigrants with Singapore-born second-generation participants.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28472538") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:28472538") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A28472538+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Participants were classified as 'first generation' if they were Indian residents born outside of Singapore and as 'second-generation' immigrants (59.7% in SINDI vs. 63.6% in SINDI-2) if they were born in Singapore.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000764> "A population-based cohort of adults of Indian ethnicity in Singapore, examined at baseline in 2007–2009 and again in 2013–2015 (SINDI-2), to study diabetic retinopathy and other major age-related eye diseases and the impact of migration, comparing first-generation immigrants with Singapore-born second-generation participants.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28472538") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:28472538") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A28472538+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Population-based cohort study.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000764> "A population-based cohort of adults of Indian ethnicity in Singapore, examined at baseline in 2007–2009 and again in 2013–2015 (SINDI-2), to study diabetic retinopathy and other major age-related eye diseases and the impact of migration, comparing first-generation immigrants with Singapore-born second-generation participants.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28472538") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:28472538") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A28472538+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "We describe the methodology of the Singapore Indian Eye Study-2 (SINDI-2) aimed to evaluate the impact of migration status on diabetic retinopathy and other major age-related eye diseases in Asian Indians living in an urban environment.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000764> "A population-based cohort of adults of Indian ethnicity in Singapore, examined at baseline in 2007–2009 and again in 2013–2015 (SINDI-2), to study diabetic retinopathy and other major age-related eye diseases and the impact of migration, comparing first-generation immigrants with Singapore-born second-generation participants.")

# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000765> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000765>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26982883") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:26982883") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4794124/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Academic centers participating include Taichung Veteran’s General Hospital, Tri-Service General Hospital and the National Taiwan University Hospital, and the National Health Research Institute in Taiwan for subject ascertainment and phenotyping.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000765> "A collaborative consortium in Taiwan, with Taichung Veterans General Hospital, Tri-Service General Hospital, National Taiwan University Hospital and the National Health Research Institutes ascertaining subjects, that genotyped Taiwanese Chinese participants of several studies with the Illumina CardioMetaboChip to identify genetic determinants of atherosclerosis- and metabolic-related traits.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26982883") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:26982883") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4794124/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The TAICHI Consortium is a collaborative study in Taiwan, with the aims to genotype a large number of Taiwanese Chinese subjects with the Illumina CardioMetaboChip and to identify genetic determinants of atherosclerosis- and metabolic-related traits [13–20].") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000765> "A collaborative consortium in Taiwan, with Taichung Veterans General Hospital, Tri-Service General Hospital, National Taiwan University Hospital and the National Health Research Institutes ascertaining subjects, that genotyped Taiwanese Chinese participants of several studies with the Illumina CardioMetaboChip to identify genetic determinants of atherosclerosis- and metabolic-related traits.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26982883") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:26982883") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A26982883+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "As part of the TAICHI Consortium, we have collected and genotyped 8556 subjects from Taiwan, comprising 5423 controls and 3133 cases with coronary artery disease, for 9087 CAD SNPs using the CardioMetaboChip.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000765> "A collaborative consortium in Taiwan, with Taichung Veterans General Hospital, Tri-Service General Hospital, National Taiwan University Hospital and the National Health Research Institutes ascertaining subjects, that genotyped Taiwanese Chinese participants of several studies with the Illumina CardioMetaboChip to identify genetic determinants of atherosclerosis- and metabolic-related traits.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26982883") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2797/MediaObjects/41588_2013_BFng2797_MOESM43_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "There are 7 principal Taiwan based cohorts that make up the current TaiChi bio-resource with a total of 11,859 subjects in the current study.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000765> "A collaborative consortium in Taiwan, with Taichung Veterans General Hospital, Tri-Service General Hospital, National Taiwan University Hospital and the National Health Research Institutes ascertaining subjects, that genotyped Taiwanese Chinese participants of several studies with the Illumina CardioMetaboChip to identify genetic determinants of atherosclerosis- and metabolic-related traits.")

# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000766> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000766>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35512400") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:38561434") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:20064828") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID:20064828%20AND%20SRC:MED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "To further investigate the relationship between menopausal hormones and risk of colon cancer, we conducted a population-based case-control study in Los Angeles County involving 831 women with newly diagnosed colon cancer and 755 population-based control women.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000766> "A population-based case-control study of colon cancer in women in Los Angeles County, United States, comprising 831 English-speaking women aged 55–74 years diagnosed with primary colon cancer from 1998 to 2002, identified through the Los Angeles County Cancer Surveillance Program (a SEER registry), and 755 race/ethnicity- and age-matched neighbourhood control women, with in-person interviews on hormone use, reproductive history and lifestyle and blood samples, set up to study menopausal hormone therapy and colon cancer risk.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35512400") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:38561434") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:38561434") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41416-024-02638-2/MediaObjects/41416_2024_2638_MOESM2_ESM.docx") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Eligible subjects were English-speaking women with a histologically confirmed primary colon cancer diagnosed between the ages of 55 and 74 years on or after January 1998 through December 2002 and who were residents of Los Angeles County.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000766> "A population-based case-control study of colon cancer in women in Los Angeles County, United States, comprising 831 English-speaking women aged 55–74 years diagnosed with primary colon cancer from 1998 to 2002, identified through the Los Angeles County Cancer Surveillance Program (a SEER registry), and 755 race/ethnicity- and age-matched neighbourhood control women, with in-person interviews on hormone use, reproductive history and lifestyle and blood samples, set up to study menopausal hormone therapy and colon cancer risk.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35512400") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:38561434") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:38561434") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41416-024-02638-2/MediaObjects/41416_2024_2638_MOESM2_ESM.docx") Annotation(rdfs:comment "In-person interviews were conducted using a structured questionnaire that covered medical, menstrual, and reproductive history, use of select hormonal and non-hormonal medications, body size, physical activity, and other lifestyle factors.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000766> "A population-based case-control study of colon cancer in women in Los Angeles County, United States, comprising 831 English-speaking women aged 55–74 years diagnosed with primary colon cancer from 1998 to 2002, identified through the Los Angeles County Cancer Surveillance Program (a SEER registry), and 755 race/ethnicity- and age-matched neighbourhood control women, with in-person interviews on hormone use, reproductive history and lifestyle and blood samples, set up to study menopausal hormone therapy and colon cancer risk.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35512400") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:38561434") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:38561434") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41416-024-02638-2/MediaObjects/41416_2024_2638_MOESM2_ESM.docx") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Race/ ethnicity and aged matched female controls were identified through a well-established neighborhood recruitment algorithm.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000766> "A population-based case-control study of colon cancer in women in Los Angeles County, United States, comprising 831 English-speaking women aged 55–74 years diagnosed with primary colon cancer from 1998 to 2002, identified through the Los Angeles County Cancer Surveillance Program (a SEER registry), and 755 race/ethnicity- and age-matched neighbourhood control women, with in-person interviews on hormone use, reproductive history and lifestyle and blood samples, set up to study menopausal hormone therapy and colon cancer risk.")

