# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000800> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000800>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:42152146") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:27197191") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5010493/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The GAME-ON Network was launched by the National Cancer Institute (NCI) to capitalize on the extensive investment in GWAS, with the overarching goal to integrate post-GWAS research and to facilitate analyses that address research questions that are common across multiple cancer sites.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000800> "A lung cancer genetic epidemiology consortium, one of the NIH-funded GAME-ON post-GWAS consortia and working with the International Lung Cancer Consortium, that integrates genome-wide data from multiple lung cancer studies of European populations to identify lung cancer susceptibility loci.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:42152146") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:27197191") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5010493/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "This study was supported by the grant from the National Institute of Health (NIH) (U19CA148127).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000800> "A lung cancer genetic epidemiology consortium, one of the NIH-funded GAME-ON post-GWAS consortia and working with the International Lung Cancer Consortium, that integrates genome-wide data from multiple lung cancer studies of European populations to identify lung cancer susceptibility loci.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:42152146") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:29924316") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A29924316+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "To ensure robust results, we further evaluated these findings using data from six additional studies that were assembled through the Transdisciplinary Research on Cancer of the Lung Consortium comprising 1993 familial cases and 33 690 controls.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000800> "A lung cancer genetic epidemiology consortium, one of the NIH-funded GAME-ON post-GWAS consortia and working with the International Lung Cancer Consortium, that integrates genome-wide data from multiple lung cancer studies of European populations to identify lung cancer susceptibility loci.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:42152146") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:42152146") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13348699/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "TRICL-ILCCO is a large international collaboration under the International Lung Cancer Consortium, integrating multiple studies across European populations.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000800> "A lung cancer genetic epidemiology consortium, one of the NIH-funded GAME-ON post-GWAS consortia and working with the International Lung Cancer Consortium, that integrates genome-wide data from multiple lung cancer studies of European populations to identify lung cancer susceptibility loci.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:42152146") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5008248/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "A more recent GWAS analysis conducted by the Transdisciplinary Research In Cancer of the Lung (TRICL) consortium identified two additional rare variants in BRCA2 and CHEK2 with large effects on susceptibility to lung squamous cell carcinomas (9).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000800> "A lung cancer genetic epidemiology consortium, one of the NIH-funded GAME-ON post-GWAS consortia and working with the International Lung Cancer Consortium, that integrates genome-wide data from multiple lung cancer studies of European populations to identify lung cancer susceptibility loci.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:42152146") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3607485/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The study was conducted under the auspices of the Transdisciplinary Research In Cancer of the Lung (TRICL) Research Team, which is a part of the Genetic Associations and MEchanisms in ONcology (GAME-ON) consortium, and associated with the International Lung Cancer Consortium (ILCCO).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000800> "A lung cancer genetic epidemiology consortium, one of the NIH-funded GAME-ON post-GWAS consortia and working with the International Lung Cancer Consortium, that integrates genome-wide data from multiple lung cancer studies of European populations to identify lung cancer susceptibility loci.")

