AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35536285") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:35536285") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9088962/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "We analyzed data from two large case–control studies—the New England Bladder Cancer Study (n/n=989 cases/1,162 controls), a population-based study") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000836> "A population-based case-control study of bladder cancer among residents of Maine, New Hampshire and Vermont, United States, with cases newly diagnosed in 2001–2004 and population controls frequency-matched on age, sex and state, used to study environmental, dietary and genetic risk factors for bladder cancer.")
