AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29892015") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:29892015") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6136836/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Details on genotyping and calling for all participating studies are listed in Supplementary Table 18.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000855> "A consortium of cohort and case-control studies with genome-wide genotype data that pools them in meta-analyses of genome-wide association studies of atrial fibrillation, to identify genetic loci for atrial fibrillation; together with the Broad AF Study, its studies formed the majority of the 2018 multi-ethnic meta-analysis of more than half a million individuals.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29892015") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:29892015") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6136836/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Genome-wide association testing on autosomal chromosomes was performed using an additive genetic effect model based on genotype probabilities.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000855> "A consortium of cohort and case-control studies with genome-wide genotype data that pools them in meta-analyses of genome-wide association studies of atrial fibrillation, to identify genetic loci for atrial fibrillation; together with the Broad AF Study, its studies formed the majority of the 2018 multi-ethnic meta-analysis of more than half a million individuals.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29892015") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:29892015") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC6136836/unicode") Annotation(rdfs:comment "In total, we identified 97 loci significantly associated with AF including 67 of which were novel in a combined-ancestry analysis, and 3 in a European specific analysis.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000855> "A consortium of cohort and case-control studies with genome-wide genotype data that pools them in meta-analyses of genome-wide association studies of atrial fibrillation, to identify genetic loci for atrial fibrillation; together with the Broad AF Study, its studies formed the majority of the 2018 multi-ethnic meta-analysis of more than half a million individuals.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29892015") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:29892015") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC6136836/unicode") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Participants were collected from both case-control studies for atrial fibrillation (AF) and population based studies.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000855> "A consortium of cohort and case-control studies with genome-wide genotype data that pools them in meta-analyses of genome-wide association studies of atrial fibrillation, to identify genetic loci for atrial fibrillation; together with the Broad AF Study, its studies formed the majority of the 2018 multi-ethnic meta-analysis of more than half a million individuals.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29892015") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:29892015") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC6136836/unicode") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The majority of studies were part of the Atrial Fibrillation Genetics (AFGen) consortium and the Broad AF Study (Broad AF).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000855> "A consortium of cohort and case-control studies with genome-wide genotype data that pools them in meta-analyses of genome-wide association studies of atrial fibrillation, to identify genetic loci for atrial fibrillation; together with the Broad AF Study, its studies formed the majority of the 2018 multi-ethnic meta-analysis of more than half a million individuals.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29892015") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:29892015") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC6136836/unicode") Annotation(rdfs:comment "We conducted the largest meta-analysis of genome-wide association studies for AF to date, consisting of over half a million individuals including 65,446 with AF.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000855> "A consortium of cohort and case-control studies with genome-wide genotype data that pools them in meta-analyses of genome-wide association studies of atrial fibrillation, to identify genetic loci for atrial fibrillation; together with the Broad AF Study, its studies formed the majority of the 2018 multi-ethnic meta-analysis of more than half a million individuals.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29892015") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3843/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3843_MOESM307_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Comparison of results for common variant loci between the AFGen Consortium combined ancestry analysis and the UK Biobank study.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000855> "A consortium of cohort and case-control studies with genome-wide genotype data that pools them in meta-analyses of genome-wide association studies of atrial fibrillation, to identify genetic loci for atrial fibrillation; together with the Broad AF Study, its studies formed the majority of the 2018 multi-ethnic meta-analysis of more than half a million individuals.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29892015") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5585859/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The Atrial Fibrillation Genetics Consortium (AFGen) is a collaboration between multiple studies with the aim of investigating the genetic causes of atrial fibrillation.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000855> "A consortium of cohort and case-control studies with genome-wide genotype data that pools them in meta-analyses of genome-wide association studies of atrial fibrillation, to identify genetic loci for atrial fibrillation; together with the Broad AF Study, its studies formed the majority of the 2018 multi-ethnic meta-analysis of more than half a million individuals.")

