AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40796244") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:40796244") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12596486/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "At enrolment, participants were aged ≥70 years (≥65 years for US minorities) without prior cardiovascular events, dementia, or independence-limiting physical disability.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000856> "A placebo-controlled randomized trial of daily low-dose aspirin in 19,114 community-dwelling adults aged 70 or over (65 or over for US minorities) in Australia and the United States without prior cardiovascular events, dementia or independence-limiting physical disability, followed as a cohort after the trial to study healthy ageing.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40796244") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:40796244") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12596486/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "From 13 June 2017, participants provided consent to ASPREE-eXTension (ASPREE-XT), an extended observational period.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000856> "A placebo-controlled randomized trial of daily low-dose aspirin in 19,114 community-dwelling adults aged 70 or over (65 or over for US minorities) in Australia and the United States without prior cardiovascular events, dementia or independence-limiting physical disability, followed as a cohort after the trial to study healthy ageing.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40796244") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:40796244") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12596486/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Randomization was to daily low-dose aspirin or matching placebo for the 4.7 years of the trial.ResultsOf the 19 114 participants randomized (9525 aspirin, 9589 placebo), 15 668 without in-trial MACE consented to post-trial follow-up.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000856> "A placebo-controlled randomized trial of daily low-dose aspirin in 19,114 community-dwelling adults aged 70 or over (65 or over for US minorities) in Australia and the United States without prior cardiovascular events, dementia or independence-limiting physical disability, followed as a cohort after the trial to study healthy ageing.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40796244") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8208779/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The ASPREE study was a randomised, placebo‐controlled trial to determine whether daily low dose aspirin increased survival, free of dementia or persistent physical disability, in 19,114 healthy community‐dwelling older people") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000856> "A placebo-controlled randomized trial of daily low-dose aspirin in 19,114 community-dwelling adults aged 70 or over (65 or over for US minorities) in Australia and the United States without prior cardiovascular events, dementia or independence-limiting physical disability, followed as a cohort after the trial to study healthy ageing.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40796244") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC10025998/unicode") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The study included genotyped participants from the ASPREE trial conducted in Australia and the United States (design and results reported previously).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000856> "A placebo-controlled randomized trial of daily low-dose aspirin in 19,114 community-dwelling adults aged 70 or over (65 or over for US minorities) in Australia and the United States without prior cardiovascular events, dementia or independence-limiting physical disability, followed as a cohort after the trial to study healthy ageing.")

