AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:42014397") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:42014397") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41467-026-71682-8/MediaObjects/41467_2026_71682_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Briefly, at the thorough physical, neurological, and psychiatric examination, as well as a clinical interview focusing on cognitive symptoms are performed as baseline visit.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000885> "A clinical sample of patients with Alzheimer's disease evaluated at the memory disorder unit of Skåne University Hospital, Sweden, with physical, neurological and psychiatric examination, a clinical interview, cognitive testing, APOE genotyping and brain imaging, whose cerebrospinal fluid Alzheimer's biomarker data were used in a genome-wide association meta-analysis.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:42014397") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:42014397") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41467-026-71682-8/MediaObjects/41467_2026_71682_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Furthermore, cognitive tests, analysis of APOE genotype, and imaging of the brain were also done.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000885> "A clinical sample of patients with Alzheimer's disease evaluated at the memory disorder unit of Skåne University Hospital, Sweden, with physical, neurological and psychiatric examination, a clinical interview, cognitive testing, APOE genotyping and brain imaging, whose cerebrospinal fluid Alzheimer's biomarker data were used in a genome-wide association meta-analysis.")
