AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:30902044") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:30902044") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6431016/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "In summary, participants were randomly selected from the Swedish national population register and invited by mail.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000889> "The Malmö sub-cohort of MrOS Sweden: 1,005 men aged 69–81, randomly selected from the Swedish national population register and examined at hospital in Malmö, Sweden, in 2001–2004, to identify risk factors for osteoporosis and fracture.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:30902044") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:30902044") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6431016/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The Osteoporotic Fractures in Men (MrOs) Sweden study is a prospective population-based multicenter observational study consisting of 3014 older men aged between 69 and 81 years at inclusion (mean age 75.4 ± (SD) 3.2 years), with the main aim to identify risk factors for osteoporosis and fracture.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000889> "The Malmö sub-cohort of MrOS Sweden: 1,005 men aged 69–81, randomly selected from the Swedish national population register and examined at hospital in Malmö, Sweden, in 2001–2004, to identify risk factors for osteoporosis and fracture.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:30902044") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:30902044") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6431016/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The participants were recruited and measured at hospitals in the three cities of Malmö (n = 1005), Gothenburg (n = 1010) and Uppsala (n = 999) between October 2001 and December 2004 with an attendance rate of 45% [16].") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000889> "The Malmö sub-cohort of MrOS Sweden: 1,005 men aged 69–81, randomly selected from the Swedish national population register and examined at hospital in Malmö, Sweden, in 2001–2004, to identify risk factors for osteoporosis and fracture.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:30902044") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:33510174") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41467-021-20918-w/MediaObjects/41467_2021_20918_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The MrOS Sweden study (n=3014) consists of three sub-cohorts from three different Swedish cities (n=1005 in Malmö, n=1010 in Gothenburg, and n=999 in Uppsala) (25).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000889> "The Malmö sub-cohort of MrOS Sweden: 1,005 men aged 69–81, randomly selected from the Swedish national population register and examined at hospital in Malmö, Sweden, in 2001–2004, to identify risk factors for osteoporosis and fracture.")

# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000890> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000890>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40366610") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:40366610") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12263719/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Over the years, three refresher cohorts (two cohorts aged 55–64 years in 2002 and in 2012, and one cohort aged 60–86 years in 2024) were added.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000890> "An ongoing prospective cohort study of older adults in the Netherlands, started in 1992 with a nationally representative sample aged 55–84 and refreshed with further cohorts in 2002, 2012 and 2024, to describe determinants, trajectories and consequences of changes in physical, cognitive, emotional and social functioning.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40366610") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:40366610") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12263719/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The Longitudinal Aging Study Amsterdam (LASA) is an ongoing prospective cohort study of older adults in the Netherlands, with data on multiple domains of functioning available over a period of more than 30 years of follow-up.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000890> "An ongoing prospective cohort study of older adults in the Netherlands, started in 1992 with a nationally representative sample aged 55–84 and refreshed with further cohorts in 2002, 2012 and 2024, to describe determinants, trajectories and consequences of changes in physical, cognitive, emotional and social functioning.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40366610") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:40366610") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12263719/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The main aim of LASA was to describe determinants, trajectories and consequences of (changes in) physical, cognitive, emotional and social functioning.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000890> "An ongoing prospective cohort study of older adults in the Netherlands, started in 1992 with a nationally representative sample aged 55–84 and refreshed with further cohorts in 2002, 2012 and 2024, to describe determinants, trajectories and consequences of changes in physical, cognitive, emotional and social functioning.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40366610") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:40366610") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12263719/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The study started in 1992 with a nationally representative sample of older adults aged 55–84 years.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000890> "An ongoing prospective cohort study of older adults in the Netherlands, started in 1992 with a nationally representative sample aged 55–84 and refreshed with further cohorts in 2002, 2012 and 2024, to describe determinants, trajectories and consequences of changes in physical, cognitive, emotional and social functioning.")

# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000891> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000891>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32374401") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:32374401") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7394962/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The FinnGeDi cohort was set up to provide a database combining detailed clinical data and DNA trio samples from mother, father and child to study genetics, epigenetics, phenotype and long-term consequences of GDM diagnosed using the new comprehensive screening guidelines.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000891> "A multicentre Finnish study of women who gave birth in 2009–2012, with a prospective genetic case-control arm of 1,146 pregnant women with gestational diabetes and 1,066 without, their children and the children’s fathers, recruited at seven hospitals, and a national register-based arm, to study the causes and consequences of gestational diabetes.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32374401") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:32374401") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7394962/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The Finnish Gestational Diabetes (FinnGeDi) study is a multicentre study that considered Finnish women who gave birth in 2009–12, as well as their children and the children’s fathers.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000891> "A multicentre Finnish study of women who gave birth in 2009–2012, with a prospective genetic case-control arm of 1,146 pregnant women with gestational diabetes and 1,066 without, their children and the children’s fathers, recruited at seven hospitals, and a national register-based arm, to study the causes and consequences of gestational diabetes.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32374401") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:32374401") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7394962/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The prospectively collected case-control cohort consists of 1146 pregnant women with GDM and 1066 women without GDM, their children from the index pregnancy and the children’s fathers.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000891> "A multicentre Finnish study of women who gave birth in 2009–2012, with a prospective genetic case-control arm of 1,146 pregnant women with gestational diabetes and 1,066 without, their children and the children’s fathers, recruited at seven hospitals, and a national register-based arm, to study the causes and consequences of gestational diabetes.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32374401") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:32374401") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7394962/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The study consisted of two arms: a prospective clinical, genetic case-control arm and a national register-based arm which also includes data on children’s siblings and grandparents.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000891> "A multicentre Finnish study of women who gave birth in 2009–2012, with a prospective genetic case-control arm of 1,146 pregnant women with gestational diabetes and 1,066 without, their children and the children’s fathers, recruited at seven hospitals, and a national register-based arm, to study the causes and consequences of gestational diabetes.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32374401") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:32374401") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7394962/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The women were recruited between 1 February 2009 and 31 December 2012 at two tertiary-level hospitals (Oulu University Hospital and Helsinki University Hospital), which serve as secondary-level hospitals for their region, and five secondary-level hospitals (in Jyväskylä, Pori, Kajaani, Seinäjoki and Lappeenranta).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000891> "A multicentre Finnish study of women who gave birth in 2009–2012, with a prospective genetic case-control arm of 1,146 pregnant women with gestational diabetes and 1,066 without, their children and the children’s fathers, recruited at seven hospitals, and a national register-based arm, to study the causes and consequences of gestational diabetes.")

