month of life, as previously described in detail8
.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000944> "A Danish clinical research programme, the Copenhagen Prospective Studies on Asthma in Childhood, made up of mother-child birth cohorts: COPSAC2000, a high-risk cohort of 411 children of mothers with a doctor's diagnosis of asthma, enrolled in the first month of life, and COPSAC2010, a cohort of 700 children born to unselected mothers from Denmark.")
