AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21390209") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:21390209") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3044719/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "All Alzheimer's disease subjects were 65 years old or older and presented with probable AD based on DSM-IV criteria or definite AD as confirmed by neuropathology findings on autopsy.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000979> "A case–control sample for Alzheimer's disease from the Quebec founder population, assembled by Genizon BioSciences, of people aged 65 or older with probable (DSM-IV) or autopsy-confirmed Alzheimer's disease and sex-matched cognitively normal controls aged 75 or older, whose blood DNA is used in genetic studies of the disease.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21390209") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:21390209") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3044719/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "All genomic DNA samples for Pfizer and Genizon were extracted from blood and quantified using Picogreen (Invitrogen Inc).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000979> "A case–control sample for Alzheimer's disease from the Quebec founder population, assembled by Genizon BioSciences, of people aged 65 or older with probable (DSM-IV) or autopsy-confirmed Alzheimer's disease and sex-matched cognitively normal controls aged 75 or older, whose blood DNA is used in genetic studies of the disease.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21390209") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:21390209") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3044719/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "All genotyping was performed at Genizon Biosciences Inc and genotype calls were generated after clustering all the data within each platform.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000979> "A case–control sample for Alzheimer's disease from the Quebec founder population, assembled by Genizon BioSciences, of people aged 65 or older with probable (DSM-IV) or autopsy-confirmed Alzheimer's disease and sex-matched cognitively normal controls aged 75 or older, whose blood DNA is used in genetic studies of the disease.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21390209") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:21390209") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3044719/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The controls were 75 years and older and were absent of AD based on a Mini-Mental State Examination (MMSE) score test> = 26 (adjusted for age and education) and a Montreal Cognitive Assessment (MoCA) score test> = 26 (adjusted for education) at the time of recruitment.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000979> "A case–control sample for Alzheimer's disease from the Quebec founder population, assembled by Genizon BioSciences, of people aged 65 or older with probable (DSM-IV) or autopsy-confirmed Alzheimer's disease and sex-matched cognitively normal controls aged 75 or older, whose blood DNA is used in genetic studies of the disease.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21390209") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:21390209") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3044719/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The controls were matched to the patients for gender.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000979> "A case–control sample for Alzheimer's disease from the Quebec founder population, assembled by Genizon BioSciences, of people aged 65 or older with probable (DSM-IV) or autopsy-confirmed Alzheimer's disease and sex-matched cognitively normal controls aged 75 or older, whose blood DNA is used in genetic studies of the disease.")

