AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35627254") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:35627254") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9142038/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "A total of 569 newly diagnosed individuals with T1D were available from three sub-cohorts, all part of The Danish Childhood Diabetes Register (DanDiabKids), described elsewhere [26,27,28].") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000982> "A sub-cohort of the Danish Childhood Diabetes Register (DanDiabKids) made up of individuals newly diagnosed with type 1 diabetes, whose serum was sampled within three months of clinical onset and who had been genotyped on the ImmunoChip array.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35627254") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:35627254") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9142038/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Both the first and second sub-cohorts had previously been genotyped with the ImmunoChip array.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0000982> "A sub-cohort of the Danish Childhood Diabetes Register (DanDiabKids) made up of individuals newly diagnosed with type 1 diabetes, whose serum was sampled within three months of clinical onset and who had been genotyped on the ImmunoChip array.")
