AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:24124113") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:34059833") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:24124113") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3968231/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The study described herein, Genetics UndeRlying Diabetes In hispANics, or GUARDIAN, was formed to eventually conduct a GWAS in seven Mexican-American cohorts of insulin sensitivity and insulin clearance directly quantified by the euglycemic clamp and FSIGT.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001045> "A family study in the Los Angeles area, United States, in which Hispanic family members of probands with type 2 diabetes were recruited to examine the genetic basis of subclinical atherosclerosis and diabetes, with insulin sensitivity measured by euglycaemic clamp.")

