# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001056> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001056>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:18830131") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20506380") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:18830131") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A18830131+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Information and biological data from a total of 2304 cases and 2227 controls have been collected and will be used in a series of analyses.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001056> "A multicentre case-control study of upper aerodigestive tract cancers (oral cavity, pharynx, larynx and oesophagus), initiated by the International Agency for Research on Cancer in 2002, that recruited newly diagnosed cases and hospital controls (population controls in the United Kingdom) at centres in about ten European countries, mostly in 2002-2005, with interviews on smoking, drinking and diet and biological samples, to study genetic susceptibility to these cancers and its interplay with lifestyle factors.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:18830131") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20506380") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:18830131") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A18830131+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "To address these issues, the International Agency for Research on Cancer initiated in 2002 the alcohol-related cancers and genetic susceptibility (ARCAGE) in Europe project, with the participation of 15 centers in 11 European countries.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001056> "A multicentre case-control study of upper aerodigestive tract cancers (oral cavity, pharynx, larynx and oesophagus), initiated by the International Agency for Research on Cancer in 2002, that recruited newly diagnosed cases and hospital controls (population controls in the United Kingdom) at centres in about ten European countries, mostly in 2002-2005, with interviews on smoking, drinking and diet and biological samples, to study genetic susceptibility to these cancers and its interplay with lifestyle factors.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:18830131") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20506380") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:20506380") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4183506/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "ARCAGE centers used hospital controls, except for centers in the United Kingdom (UK), which used population-based controls.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001056> "A multicentre case-control study of upper aerodigestive tract cancers (oral cavity, pharynx, larynx and oesophagus), initiated by the International Agency for Research on Cancer in 2002, that recruited newly diagnosed cases and hospital controls (population controls in the United Kingdom) at centres in about ten European countries, mostly in 2002-2005, with interviews on smoking, drinking and diet and biological samples, to study genetic susceptibility to these cancers and its interplay with lifestyle factors.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:18830131") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20506380") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:20506380") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4183506/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "In short, this study was designed to investigate and clarify the role of smoking, drinking, and genetic factors in UADT cancers.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001056> "A multicentre case-control study of upper aerodigestive tract cancers (oral cavity, pharynx, larynx and oesophagus), initiated by the International Agency for Research on Cancer in 2002, that recruited newly diagnosed cases and hospital controls (population controls in the United Kingdom) at centres in about ten European countries, mostly in 2002-2005, with interviews on smoking, drinking and diet and biological samples, to study genetic susceptibility to these cancers and its interplay with lifestyle factors.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:18830131") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20506380") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:20506380") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4183506/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Recruitment was conducted from 2002 to 2005 for all centers, except for the French center, where recruitment was conducted during 1987 to 1992.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001056> "A multicentre case-control study of upper aerodigestive tract cancers (oral cavity, pharynx, larynx and oesophagus), initiated by the International Agency for Research on Cancer in 2002, that recruited newly diagnosed cases and hospital controls (population controls in the United Kingdom) at centres in about ten European countries, mostly in 2002-2005, with interviews on smoking, drinking and diet and biological samples, to study genetic susceptibility to these cancers and its interplay with lifestyle factors.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:18830131") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20506380") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:20506380") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4183506/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "UADT cancers included the following subsites: oral, pharyngeal, hypopharyngeal, laryngeal, and esophageal cancers.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001056> "A multicentre case-control study of upper aerodigestive tract cancers (oral cavity, pharynx, larynx and oesophagus), initiated by the International Agency for Research on Cancer in 2002, that recruited newly diagnosed cases and hospital controls (population controls in the United Kingdom) at centres in about ten European countries, mostly in 2002-2005, with interviews on smoking, drinking and diet and biological samples, to study genetic susceptibility to these cancers and its interplay with lifestyle factors.")

# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001057> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001057>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26708676") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29310044") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29706931") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:39286457") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:29310044") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A29310044+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "This time-stratified case-crossover study was based on IS and transient ischemic attacks (TIA) recorded in a hospital-based prospective stroke register (BASICMAR 2005-2014) in Barcelona (Catalonia, Spain).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001057> "A prospective hospital-based register of patients admitted with acute stroke to Hospital del Mar, a tertiary public university hospital serving about 330,000 people in three districts of Barcelona, Spain, with records from 2005 onwards, standardised clinical and imaging assessment and outcome follow-up; its patients who gave DNA form the BASICMAR genetic study, a contributing site of the NINDS Stroke Genetics Network.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26708676") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29310044") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29706931") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:39286457") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:29706931") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5908882/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Mortality and disability data, vascular recurrences, and the detection of previously non-diagnosed AF were obtained from a clinic visit at 3-month and 5-year follow-up, from electronic medical records, hospital admissions records, or by telephone contact with primary care physicians.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001057> "A prospective hospital-based register of patients admitted with acute stroke to Hospital del Mar, a tertiary public university hospital serving about 330,000 people in three districts of Barcelona, Spain, with records from 2005 onwards, standardised clinical and imaging assessment and outcome follow-up; its patients who gave DNA form the BASICMAR genetic study, a contributing site of the NINDS Stroke Genetics Network.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26708676") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29310044") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29706931") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:39286457") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:29706931") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5908882/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The BASICMAR database (18) is an ongoing prospective register of patients with acute stroke at University Hospital del Mar, a tertiary public hospital serving a population of 330,000 in three districts of the city of Barcelona.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001057> "A prospective hospital-based register of patients admitted with acute stroke to Hospital del Mar, a tertiary public university hospital serving about 330,000 people in three districts of Barcelona, Spain, with records from 2005 onwards, standardised clinical and imaging assessment and outcome follow-up; its patients who gave DNA form the BASICMAR genetic study, a contributing site of the NINDS Stroke Genetics Network.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26708676") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29310044") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29706931") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:39286457") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5191861/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Examinations were performed and standardized questionnaires administered during the hospitalization by a team of neurologists and reviewed by an additional neurologist.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001057> "A prospective hospital-based register of patients admitted with acute stroke to Hospital del Mar, a tertiary public university hospital serving about 330,000 people in three districts of Barcelona, Spain, with records from 2005 onwards, standardised clinical and imaging assessment and outcome follow-up; its patients who gave DNA form the BASICMAR genetic study, a contributing site of the NINDS Stroke Genetics Network.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26708676") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29310044") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29706931") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:39286457") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5191861/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Inclusion criteria in BASICMAR cohorts were as follows: (1) first-ever IS, (2) brain imaging with CT or MRI, (3) availability of clinical data supporting the assigned stroke subtype according to TOAST classification [45], (4) absence of intracranial hemorrhage, neoplasms, demyelinating and autoimmune diseases, and vasculitides.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001057> "A prospective hospital-based register of patients admitted with acute stroke to Hospital del Mar, a tertiary public university hospital serving about 330,000 people in three districts of Barcelona, Spain, with records from 2005 onwards, standardised clinical and imaging assessment and outcome follow-up; its patients who gave DNA form the BASICMAR genetic study, a contributing site of the NINDS Stroke Genetics Network.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26708676") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29310044") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29706931") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:39286457") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5191861/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The Chemagic Magnetic Separation Module I system (Chemagen) and the Autopure LS (Qiagen) were used for DNA isolation in the BASICMAR patient cohort; only the Autopure LS (Qiagen) was used in the REGICOR cohort.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001057> "A prospective hospital-based register of patients admitted with acute stroke to Hospital del Mar, a tertiary public university hospital serving about 330,000 people in three districts of Barcelona, Spain, with records from 2005 onwards, standardised clinical and imaging assessment and outcome follow-up; its patients who gave DNA form the BASICMAR genetic study, a contributing site of the NINDS Stroke Genetics Network.")

# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001058> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001058>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35414113") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:38178900") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:39586971") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:35414113") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1186%2Fs13058-022-01524-0/MediaObjects/13058_2022_1524_MOESM1_ESM.docx") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Cases are hospital-based and controls are either hospital-based, part of a breast cancer screening program or recruited by a newspaper advertisement.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001058> "A case-control study of breast cancer based at the University Breast Center for Franconia, Erlangen University Hospital, Bavaria, Germany, which in the 2000s enrolled women aged 18 or older with invasive breast cancer treated there, with tumour tissue for tissue microarrays, and controls recruited in hospital, through a breast cancer screening programme or by newspaper advertisement, to study genetic and non-genetic risk factors and prognostic and predictive factors of breast cancer.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35414113") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:38178900") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:39586971") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:38178900") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10764119/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "From 2002–2007, a total of 1538 patients were included in the study ( Fig. 1 ).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001058> "A case-control study of breast cancer based at the University Breast Center for Franconia, Erlangen University Hospital, Bavaria, Germany, which in the 2000s enrolled women aged 18 or older with invasive breast cancer treated there, with tumour tissue for tissue microarrays, and controls recruited in hospital, through a breast cancer screening programme or by newspaper advertisement, to study genetic and non-genetic risk factors and prognostic and predictive factors of breast cancer.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35414113") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:38178900") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:39586971") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:38178900") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10764119/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Patients were eligible if they were at least 18 years of age and had been diagnosed with invasive breast cancer.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001058> "A case-control study of breast cancer based at the University Breast Center for Franconia, Erlangen University Hospital, Bavaria, Germany, which in the 2000s enrolled women aged 18 or older with invasive breast cancer treated there, with tumour tissue for tissue microarrays, and controls recruited in hospital, through a breast cancer screening programme or by newspaper advertisement, to study genetic and non-genetic risk factors and prognostic and predictive factors of breast cancer.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35414113") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:38178900") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:39586971") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:38178900") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10764119/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Primary tumors were available from 894 of these patients for the construction of a tissue microarray (TMA) with 0.8 mm per dot.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001058> "A case-control study of breast cancer based at the University Breast Center for Franconia, Erlangen University Hospital, Bavaria, Germany, which in the 2000s enrolled women aged 18 or older with invasive breast cancer treated there, with tumour tissue for tissue microarrays, and controls recruited in hospital, through a breast cancer screening programme or by newspaper advertisement, to study genetic and non-genetic risk factors and prognostic and predictive factors of breast cancer.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35414113") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:38178900") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:39586971") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:38178900") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10764119/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The Bavarian Breast Cancer Cases and Controls (BBCC) study is a case–control study aimed at investigating molecular and epidemiological breast cancer risk, prognostic, and predictive factors 17 21 22 23 24 25 26 .") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001058> "A case-control study of breast cancer based at the University Breast Center for Franconia, Erlangen University Hospital, Bavaria, Germany, which in the 2000s enrolled women aged 18 or older with invasive breast cancer treated there, with tumour tissue for tissue microarrays, and controls recruited in hospital, through a breast cancer screening programme or by newspaper advertisement, to study genetic and non-genetic risk factors and prognostic and predictive factors of breast cancer.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35414113") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:38178900") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:39586971") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:39586971") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11787164/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The BBCC study was a case–control study that initially included 1538 women with breast cancer, described in detail elsewhere [17], who received various treatments in accordance with University Breast Center guidelines at the University Breast Center for Franconia, which is part of Erlangen University Hospital (Bavaria, Germany).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001058> "A case-control study of breast cancer based at the University Breast Center for Franconia, Erlangen University Hospital, Bavaria, Germany, which in the 2000s enrolled women aged 18 or older with invasive breast cancer treated there, with tumour tissue for tissue microarrays, and controls recruited in hospital, through a breast cancer screening programme or by newspaper advertisement, to study genetic and non-genetic risk factors and prognostic and predictive factors of breast cancer.")

