AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:16623958") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:33732727") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:16623958") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC1524813/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The baseline examinations (BMES cross-section I) were conducted during 1992–1994 and included 3654 (82.4%) of 4433 eligible residents.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001061> "A population-based cohort study of common eye diseases and other health outcomes among permanent residents aged 49 years or older of two postcode areas in the Blue Mountains, west of Sydney, Australia, identified through a census and examined at baseline in 1992–1994 and then every five years to 2007–2009, with newly eligible residents added in an extension study in 1999–2000.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:16623958") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:33732727") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:16623958") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC1524813/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The study involved eligible permanent residents aged 49 years and older, living in two postcode areas in the Blue Mountains, west of Sydney, Australia.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001061> "A population-based cohort study of common eye diseases and other health outcomes among permanent residents aged 49 years or older of two postcode areas in the Blue Mountains, west of Sydney, Australia, identified through a census and examined at baseline in 1992–1994 and then every five years to 2007–2009, with newly eligible residents added in an extension study in 1999–2000.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:16623958") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:33732727") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:33732727") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7957007/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Baseline data collection (BMES 1) was conducted between 1992 and 1994 and subsequent data were collected every 5 years (BMES 2:1997–99, BMES 3:2002–04, and BMES 4:2007–09).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001061> "A population-based cohort study of common eye diseases and other health outcomes among permanent residents aged 49 years or older of two postcode areas in the Blue Mountains, west of Sydney, Australia, identified through a census and examined at baseline in 1992–1994 and then every five years to 2007–2009, with newly eligible residents added in an extension study in 1999–2000.")

