AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:42237039") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Sonnet 5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:42237039") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13263136/supplementaryFiles") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The control
sample comprised of individuals from the population-based study Heinz Nixdorf Recall (HNR) study cohort.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001062> "A cohort of Alzheimer's disease cases and controls in Germany, drawn from a larger German GWAS sample recruited through the German Dementia Competence Network, the AgeCoDe study of ageing, cognition and dementia in primary care patients, and the Memory Clinic at the University Hospital of Bonn. Controls were drawn from the population-based Heinz Nixdorf Recall study cohort.")
