AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:22614287") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:36804072") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:22614287") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4724864/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "All aspects of the study, including recruitment of anonymous samples via the clozapine monitoring service, were approved by relevant ethics panels and were in accordance with the UK Human Tissue Act.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001068> "A sample of people in the United Kingdom with treatment-resistant schizophrenia who were prescribed clozapine, whose anonymised blood samples and clinical monitoring data were obtained through the clozapine monitoring services, first in collaboration with Novartis and later through the Zaponex Treatment Access System (second wave 2013–15, third wave 2019–21), for Cardiff University's genetic studies of schizophrenia and clozapine metabolism.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:22614287") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:36804072") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:22614287") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4724864/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Through collaboration with Novartis, the manufacturer of a proprietary form of clozapine (Clozaril), we acquired blood from people with treatment resistant schizophrenia according to the clozapine registration forms completed by treating psychiatrists.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001068> "A sample of people in the United Kingdom with treatment-resistant schizophrenia who were prescribed clozapine, whose anonymised blood samples and clinical monitoring data were obtained through the clozapine monitoring services, first in collaboration with Novartis and later through the Zaponex Treatment Access System (second wave 2013–15, third wave 2019–21), for Cardiff University's genetic studies of schizophrenia and clozapine metabolism.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:22614287") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:36804072") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:36804072") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10824469/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Data from people in CLOZUK2 of European ancestry were reported previously as part of genome-wide analyses of schizophrenia and clozapine metabolism") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001068> "A sample of people in the United Kingdom with treatment-resistant schizophrenia who were prescribed clozapine, whose anonymised blood samples and clinical monitoring data were obtained through the clozapine monitoring services, first in collaboration with Novartis and later through the Zaponex Treatment Access System (second wave 2013–15, third wave 2019–21), for Cardiff University's genetic studies of schizophrenia and clozapine metabolism.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:22614287") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:36804072") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:36804072") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10824469/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "In this GWAS, we analysed data from the UK Zaponex Treatment Access System clozapine monitoring service as part of the CLOZUK study.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001068> "A sample of people in the United Kingdom with treatment-resistant schizophrenia who were prescribed clozapine, whose anonymised blood samples and clinical monitoring data were obtained through the clozapine monitoring services, first in collaboration with Novartis and later through the Zaponex Treatment Access System (second wave 2013–15, third wave 2019–21), for Cardiff University's genetic studies of schizophrenia and clozapine metabolism.")
