AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32139696") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35395775") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/study.cgi?study_id=phs000799.v1.p1") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:35395775") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8991589/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The samples from the SBCGS were genotyped using Affymetrix Genome-Wide Human SNP Array 6.0.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001229> "A breast cancer case-control genetics study, led from Vanderbilt University, that genotyped Chinese women with breast cancer and controls drawn from four population-based studies in urban Shanghai, China: the Shanghai Breast Cancer Study, the Shanghai Breast Cancer Survival Study, the Shanghai Women's Health Study and, for controls only, the Shanghai Endometrial Cancer Study.")
