AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20729852") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21846596") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28680059") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:34022824") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:34022824") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8141232/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The Shanxi Upper Gastrointestinal Cancer Genetics Project was supported by the National Cancer Institute contract NO2-SC-66211 with the Shanxi Cancer Hospital and Institute.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001234> "A case-control study of upper gastrointestinal cancers conducted from 1997 to 2007 by the Shanxi Cancer Hospital and Institute under contract with the US National Cancer Institute in Shanxi Province, China, in the high-risk western Taihang Mountain area, which enrolled adults newly diagnosed with oesophageal squamous cell carcinoma or gastric adenocarcinoma and treated surgically at the Shanxi Cancer Hospital, with neighbourhood controls matched on age and sex, plus a case-only component, and collected questionnaire data and blood to study genetic and environmental risk factors for these cancers.")

