AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23461817") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:9294370") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:9413795") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23461817") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://doi.org/10.1017/thg.2013.6") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The VTSABD is a cohort-longitudinal study of twins born between 1974 and 1983, ascertained primarily through the state school system and participating private schools in Virginia.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001248> "A population-based, cohort-sequential longitudinal study of European-ancestry twin pairs born in 1974-1983, ascertained at ages 8 to 16 through the state and participating private schools of Virginia, United States, who with their parents were assessed by psychiatric interviews and questionnaires in four waves about 18 months apart and again in their mid-20s, to study genetic and environmental influences on the development of child and adolescent psychopathology and substance use.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23461817") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:9294370") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:9413795") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23461817") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://doi.org/10.1017/thg.2013.6") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The study was limited to subjects of European ancestry as insufficient numbers from other ancestry groups were ascertainable.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001248> "A population-based, cohort-sequential longitudinal study of European-ancestry twin pairs born in 1974-1983, ascertained at ages 8 to 16 through the state and participating private schools of Virginia, United States, who with their parents were assessed by psychiatric interviews and questionnaires in four waves about 18 months apart and again in their mid-20s, to study genetic and environmental influences on the development of child and adolescent psychopathology and substance use.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23461817") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:9294370") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:9413795") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23461817") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://doi.org/10.1017/thg.2013.6") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Three subsequent waves of data collection occurred at approximately 1½-year intervals, and the fifth wave when participants were in their mid-twenties (see Table 1).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001248> "A population-based, cohort-sequential longitudinal study of European-ancestry twin pairs born in 1974-1983, ascertained at ages 8 to 16 through the state and participating private schools of Virginia, United States, who with their parents were assessed by psychiatric interviews and questionnaires in four waves about 18 months apart and again in their mid-20s, to study genetic and environmental influences on the development of child and adolescent psychopathology and substance use.")
