AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28983737") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:34127860") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-10") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:28983737") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5719131/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Using ImmunoChip data from 15,696 cases, we aimed to identify regions in the genome associated with AAD.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001259> "A collection from Northern Ireland of people with type 1 diabetes, most of them diagnosed in childhood, and independent controls, analysed separately from the Genetic Resource Investigating Diabetes (GRID) cases of Great Britain and genotyped on the ImmunoChip at the University of Virginia under the Type 1 Diabetes Genetics Consortium grant for genetic studies of type 1 diabetes.")
