AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:27135401") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:30093612") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40633141") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:27135401") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3562/MediaObjects/41588_2016_BFng3562_MOESM302_ESM.xlsx") Annotation(rdfs:comment "BECS/HJECS | Bavarian Endometrial Cancer Study/Hannover-Jena Endometrial Cancer Study | Germany; hospital-based cases, population-based cases") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001316> "An international consortium of population- and hospital-based endometrial cancer studies in Europe, North America and Australia, whose cases of European ancestry were genotyped on the iCOGS and OncoArray arrays and compared with country-matched controls, mainly from the Breast Cancer Association Consortium, in genome-wide association studies of endometrial cancer risk.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:27135401") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:30093612") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40633141") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:27135401") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4907351/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "For the iCOGS genotyping stage, 4,330 women with a confirmed diagnosis of endometrial cancer and European ancestry were recruited via 11 studies in Western Europe, North America and Australia, collectively called the Endometrial Cancer Association Consortium (ECAC).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001316> "An international consortium of population- and hospital-based endometrial cancer studies in Europe, North America and Australia, whose cases of European ancestry were genotyped on the iCOGS and OncoArray arrays and compared with country-matched controls, mainly from the Breast Cancer Association Consortium, in genome-wide association studies of endometrial cancer risk.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:27135401") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:30093612") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40633141") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:27135401") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4907351/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Healthy female controls with European ancestry and known age at sampling were selected from controls genotyped by the Breast Cancer Association Consortium (BCAC)15 or Ovarian Cancer Association Consortium (OCAC)16 iCOGS projects.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001316> "An international consortium of population- and hospital-based endometrial cancer studies in Europe, North America and Australia, whose cases of European ancestry were genotyped on the iCOGS and OncoArray arrays and compared with country-matched controls, mainly from the Breast Cancer Association Consortium, in genome-wide association studies of endometrial cancer risk.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:27135401") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:30093612") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40633141") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:30093612") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6085317/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The 5061 OncoArray-genotyped endometrial cancer cases were country-matched to controls who had been genotyped in an identical process as part of the Breast Cancer Association Consortium35,36.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001316> "An international consortium of population- and hospital-based endometrial cancer studies in Europe, North America and Australia, whose cases of European ancestry were genotyped on the iCOGS and OncoArray arrays and compared with country-matched controls, mainly from the Breast Cancer Association Consortium, in genome-wide association studies of endometrial cancer risk.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:27135401") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:30093612") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40633141") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:40633141") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12275056/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Building on genome-wide association studies (GWASs) by the Endometrial Cancer Association Consortium, we conducted a GWAS meta-analysis of 17,278 endometrial cancer cases and 289,180 controls, incorporating biobank samples from the UK, Finland, Estonia and Japan.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001316> "An international consortium of population- and hospital-based endometrial cancer studies in Europe, North America and Australia, whose cases of European ancestry were genotyped on the iCOGS and OncoArray arrays and compared with country-matched controls, mainly from the Breast Cancer Association Consortium, in genome-wide association studies of endometrial cancer risk.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:27135401") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:30093612") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40633141") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:40633141") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12275056/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Much of this information has been obtained from large case-control studies conducted within two international consortia: the Endometrial Cancer Association Consortium (ECAC) and the Epidemiology of Endometrial Cancer Consortium (E2C2).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001316> "An international consortium of population- and hospital-based endometrial cancer studies in Europe, North America and Australia, whose cases of European ancestry were genotyped on the iCOGS and OncoArray arrays and compared with country-matched controls, mainly from the Breast Cancer Association Consortium, in genome-wide association studies of endometrial cancer risk.")

