AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21474410") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26237428") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:21474410") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A21474410+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The Western Australian Melanoma Health Study (WAMHS) is a population-based case-collection and biospecimen resource established to investigate the genetic epidemiology of melanoma.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001432> "A population-based collection of adult melanoma cases resident in Western Australia and diagnosed between January 2006 and September 2009, identified through the Western Australian Cancer Registry and invited by mail with their diagnosing doctor's consent, with registry pathology data, a telephone questionnaire on melanoma risk factors such as sun exposure and skin type, and blood samples for DNA, RNA and serum, established to investigate the genetic epidemiology of melanoma.")

