AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20485516") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:20485516") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC2869325/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Each blood pool was genotyped on Illumina Human 1M-Duo V3 arrays at QIMR, with four replications.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001462> "A population-based sample of unrelated adults from Adelaide, Australia, with measured central corneal thickness, whose members in the thinnest and thickest fifths of the distribution had equal volumes of whole blood pooled before DNA extraction and genotyped as case and control pools in a genome-wide association study of central corneal thickness.")
