AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35906442") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:37924421") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40983397") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:35906442") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9338160/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Camargo cohort participants are monitored every 4 years.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001552> "A prospective community-based cohort of postmenopausal women and men aged 50 years and older who attended a primary care centre in Camargo, Cantabria, in northern Spain, for a regular health examination or for medical reasons, enrolled between February 2006 and February 2011 and re-evaluated in later waves to study the prevalence and incidence of metabolic bone diseases and the risk factors for osteoporosis and fragility fractures.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35906442") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:37924421") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40983397") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:35906442") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9338160/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The cohort was set up with postmenopausal women and men aged 50 years and older attending a Primary Care Center in Northern Spain for medical reasons or for their regular health examination.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001552> "A prospective community-based cohort of postmenopausal women and men aged 50 years and older who attended a primary care centre in Camargo, Cantabria, in northern Spain, for a regular health examination or for medical reasons, enrolled between February 2006 and February 2011 and re-evaluated in later waves to study the prevalence and incidence of metabolic bone diseases and the risk factors for osteoporosis and fragility fractures.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35906442") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:37924421") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40983397") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:35906442") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9338160/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The study was carried out with people included in the Camargo cohort, a prospective community-based cohort designed to evaluate the prevalence and incidence of metabolic bone diseases and risk factors for osteoporosis and fragility fractures.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001552> "A prospective community-based cohort of postmenopausal women and men aged 50 years and older who attended a primary care centre in Camargo, Cantabria, in northern Spain, for a regular health examination or for medical reasons, enrolled between February 2006 and February 2011 and re-evaluated in later waves to study the prevalence and incidence of metabolic bone diseases and the risk factors for osteoporosis and fragility fractures.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35906442") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:37924421") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40983397") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:37924421") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11031476/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The study was set up between February 2006 and February 2011, and full details of this cohort have been previously reported [28–31].") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001552> "A prospective community-based cohort of postmenopausal women and men aged 50 years and older who attended a primary care centre in Camargo, Cantabria, in northern Spain, for a regular health examination or for medical reasons, enrolled between February 2006 and February 2011 and re-evaluated in later waves to study the prevalence and incidence of metabolic bone diseases and the risk factors for osteoporosis and fragility fractures.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35906442") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:37924421") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40983397") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC4102322/unicode") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The Cantabria-Camargo (CABRIO-C) and Cantabria Case–Control (CABRIO-CC) studies are based in Northern Spain.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001552> "A prospective community-based cohort of postmenopausal women and men aged 50 years and older who attended a primary care centre in Camargo, Cantabria, in northern Spain, for a regular health examination or for medical reasons, enrolled between February 2006 and February 2011 and re-evaluated in later waves to study the prevalence and incidence of metabolic bone diseases and the risk factors for osteoporosis and fragility fractures.")

# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001553> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001553>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:17118999") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:17218734") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2249/MediaObjects/41588_2012_BFng2249_MOESM26_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:17118999") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A17118999+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The objective of the investigation was to study the relationship of a set of single nucleotide polymorphisms (SNPs) of the aromatase gene with osteoporosis and determine their functional influence on gene transcription.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001553> "A clinic-based, cross-sectional case-control study of patients with osteoporosis and control individuals, including volunteers, living in Cantabria in northern Spain and recruited in Santander, used to study genetic and hormonal determinants of bone mineral density and osteoporotic fracture.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:17118999") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:17218734") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2249/MediaObjects/41588_2012_BFng2249_MOESM26_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:17218734") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A17218734+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The objective of this study was to explore the influence of several anthropometric, lifestyle, genetic, and hormonal factors on BMD and analyze the possible differences in men and women.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001553> "A clinic-based, cross-sectional case-control study of patients with osteoporosis and control individuals, including volunteers, living in Cantabria in northern Spain and recruited in Santander, used to study genetic and hormonal determinants of bone mineral density and osteoporotic fracture.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:17118999") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:17218734") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2249/MediaObjects/41588_2012_BFng2249_MOESM26_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://static-content.springer.com/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2249/MediaObjects/41588_2012_BFng2249_MOESM26_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "CABRIO‐CC Cantabria Osteoporosis Case‐control Case‐control, cross‐sectional Clinic‐based plus volunteers Spain Santander Caucasian (Spanish) 2,321 Clinic‐based study of control individuals and patients with osteoporosis living in Cantabria, a region in Northern Spain") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001553> "A clinic-based, cross-sectional case-control study of patients with osteoporosis and control individuals, including volunteers, living in Cantabria in northern Spain and recruited in Santander, used to study genetic and hormonal determinants of bone mineral density and osteoporotic fracture.")

