AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20700438") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23143601") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23143601") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2456/MediaObjects/41588_2012_BFng2456_MOESM34_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Controlswere from a communitynutritional survey.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001562> "A lung cancer case–control study of ethnic Han Chinese, carried out from 1997 to 2008, in which cases were recruited from Beijing and surrounding provinces at the Cancer Hospital of the Chinese Academy of Medical Sciences in Beijing, China, and cancer-free controls from the same region and period were drawn from a community nutritional survey, to study genetic susceptibility to lung cancer; its never-smoking women take part in the genome-wide association studies of the Female Lung Cancer Consortium in Asia.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20700438") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23143601") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23143601") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2456/MediaObjects/41588_2012_BFng2456_MOESM34_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Subjects were cancer-free individuals in the same region duringthe same period as the cases were collected.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001562> "A lung cancer case–control study of ethnic Han Chinese, carried out from 1997 to 2008, in which cases were recruited from Beijing and surrounding provinces at the Cancer Hospital of the Chinese Academy of Medical Sciences in Beijing, China, and cancer-free controls from the same region and period were drawn from a community nutritional survey, to study genetic susceptibility to lung cancer; its never-smoking women take part in the genome-wide association studies of the Female Lung Cancer Consortium in Asia.")

# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001563> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001563>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28604730") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:24004118") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC3951177/unicode") Annotation(rdfs:comment "In the BCCA studies, low-dose CT scanning was initially performed on a single-slice CT scanner and subsequently on 4-, 8-, or 16-detector CT scanners, as reported previously.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001563> "A Canadian lung cancer case–control sample, drawn as nested case–control sets for the OncoArray lung cancer genome-wide association project from three low-dose computed tomography screening programmes for smokers: the International Early Lung Cancer Action Program site in the Greater Toronto Area organised by Princess Margaret Hospital (enrolling since 2003), the PanCan study, which screened smokers aged 50 to 75 in eight cities across Canada from 2008 to 2011, and the screening programme of the British Columbia Cancer Agency (BCCA), which enrolled heavy smokers from 1990 to 2007.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28604730") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:24004118") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC3951177/unicode") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The validation data set included participants involved in chemoprevention trials at the British Columbia Cancer Agency (BCCA)") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001563> "A Canadian lung cancer case–control sample, drawn as nested case–control sets for the OncoArray lung cancer genome-wide association project from three low-dose computed tomography screening programmes for smokers: the International Early Lung Cancer Action Program site in the Greater Toronto Area organised by Princess Margaret Hospital (enrolling since 2003), the PanCan study, which screened smokers aged 50 to 75 in eight cities across Canada from 2008 to 2011, and the screening programme of the British Columbia Cancer Agency (BCCA), which enrolled heavy smokers from 1990 to 2007.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28604730") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:28604730") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "A total of 2537 smokers have been screened from 2008 to 2011.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001563> "A Canadian lung cancer case–control sample, drawn as nested case–control sets for the OncoArray lung cancer genome-wide association project from three low-dose computed tomography screening programmes for smokers: the International Early Lung Cancer Action Program site in the Greater Toronto Area organised by Princess Margaret Hospital (enrolling since 2003), the PanCan study, which screened smokers aged 50 to 75 in eight cities across Canada from 2008 to 2011, and the screening programme of the British Columbia Cancer Agency (BCCA), which enrolled heavy smokers from 1990 to 2007.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28604730") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:28604730") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "A total of 9759 individuals participated in the CT screening program in Canada from these 3 programs.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001563> "A Canadian lung cancer case–control sample, drawn as nested case–control sets for the OncoArray lung cancer genome-wide association project from three low-dose computed tomography screening programmes for smokers: the International Early Lung Cancer Action Program site in the Greater Toronto Area organised by Princess Margaret Hospital (enrolling since 2003), the PanCan study, which screened smokers aged 50 to 75 in eight cities across Canada from 2008 to 2011, and the screening programme of the British Columbia Cancer Agency (BCCA), which enrolled heavy smokers from 1990 to 2007.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28604730") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:28604730") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "BCCA Screening Program: Between 1990 to 2007, 4274 smokers above 40 years old who had smoked 20 pack-years or more were enrolled at BCCA.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001563> "A Canadian lung cancer case–control sample, drawn as nested case–control sets for the OncoArray lung cancer genome-wide association project from three low-dose computed tomography screening programmes for smokers: the International Early Lung Cancer Action Program site in the Greater Toronto Area organised by Princess Margaret Hospital (enrolling since 2003), the PanCan study, which screened smokers aged 50 to 75 in eight cities across Canada from 2008 to 2011, and the screening programme of the British Columbia Cancer Agency (BCCA), which enrolled heavy smokers from 1990 to 2007.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28604730") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:28604730") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "It includes the nested case-control samples from 3 screening programs: IELCAP- Toronto: Ever smokers of more than 10 pack-years age 50 and above were eligible for the I-ELCAP screening program since 2003, and a total of 4782 individuals have been enrolled in the Greater Toronto Area.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001563> "A Canadian lung cancer case–control sample, drawn as nested case–control sets for the OncoArray lung cancer genome-wide association project from three low-dose computed tomography screening programmes for smokers: the International Early Lung Cancer Action Program site in the Greater Toronto Area organised by Princess Margaret Hospital (enrolling since 2003), the PanCan study, which screened smokers aged 50 to 75 in eight cities across Canada from 2008 to 2011, and the screening programme of the British Columbia Cancer Agency (BCCA), which enrolled heavy smokers from 1990 to 2007.")
