AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26822151") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:27468926") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:34419046") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://clinicaltrials.gov/api/v2/studies/NCT00590200") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:34419046") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC8379781/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Subjects were followed for 3 years following enrollment to determine the occurrence of MACE, defined as all-cause mortality, nonfatal myocardial infarction, or nonfatal stroke.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001576> "A single-centre prospective cohort and sample repository of consecutive adults undergoing elective diagnostic coronary angiography or elective cardiac computed tomographic angiography at the Cleveland Clinic, Cleveland, Ohio, United States, enrolled from 2001 to 2007 with blood samples, extensive clinical and laboratory characterisation and adjudicated follow-up for death, myocardial infarction and stroke, set up to study the genetic and molecular determinants of coronary artery disease.")

