# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001622> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001622>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23349703") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/201379/reporting") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23349703") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3548843/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "In brief, all participants were male heavy smokers (≥20 or more pack-years), aged between 50–75 years and fit enough to undergo surgery.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001622> "A cohort of male heavy smokers (at least 20 pack-years) aged 50–75, participants of the Dutch-Belgian NELSON lung cancer screening trial recruited by the University Medical Centers of Groningen and Utrecht in the Netherlands, with spirometry, low-dose chest CT and blood DNA and RNA. It was assembled and genotyped genome-wide as the discovery cohort of the European Union FP7 project COPACETIC, begun in 2008 under the coordination of UMC Utrecht, to find genetic determinants of susceptibility to COPD and emphysema in smokers, and its lung function was measured again after about three years.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23349703") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/201379/reporting") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23349703") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3548843/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "In particular, COPACETIC genotypes were extracted from Human610-Quad BeadChip data generated in the COPACETIC GWAS (Illumina Inc., San Diego, CA, USA), whereas LEUVEN participants were genotyped in a blinded manner using iPLEX technology on a MassARRAY Compact Analyser (Sequenom Inc., San Diego, CA, USA).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001622> "A cohort of male heavy smokers (at least 20 pack-years) aged 50–75, participants of the Dutch-Belgian NELSON lung cancer screening trial recruited by the University Medical Centers of Groningen and Utrecht in the Netherlands, with spirometry, low-dose chest CT and blood DNA and RNA. It was assembled and genotyped genome-wide as the discovery cohort of the European Union FP7 project COPACETIC, begun in 2008 under the coordination of UMC Utrecht, to find genetic determinants of susceptibility to COPD and emphysema in smokers, and its lung function was measured again after about three years.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23349703") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/201379/reporting") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23349703") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3548843/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The COPACETIC cohort included 1,226 Dutch participants from the NELSON lung cancer screening trial recruited by the University Medical Centers of Groningen and Utrecht [17].") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001622> "A cohort of male heavy smokers (at least 20 pack-years) aged 50–75, participants of the Dutch-Belgian NELSON lung cancer screening trial recruited by the University Medical Centers of Groningen and Utrecht in the Netherlands, with spirometry, low-dose chest CT and blood DNA and RNA. It was assembled and genotyped genome-wide as the discovery cohort of the European Union FP7 project COPACETIC, begun in 2008 under the coordination of UMC Utrecht, to find genetic determinants of susceptibility to COPD and emphysema in smokers, and its lung function was measured again after about three years.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23349703") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/201379/reporting") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23349703") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3548843/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "To investigate the influence of genetic variability on decline in FEV1 and FEV1/FVC, pulmonary function tests were performed at inclusion and after three years of follow-up in COPACETIC.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001622> "A cohort of male heavy smokers (at least 20 pack-years) aged 50–75, participants of the Dutch-Belgian NELSON lung cancer screening trial recruited by the University Medical Centers of Groningen and Utrecht in the Netherlands, with spirometry, low-dose chest CT and blood DNA and RNA. It was assembled and genotyped genome-wide as the discovery cohort of the European Union FP7 project COPACETIC, begun in 2008 under the coordination of UMC Utrecht, to find genetic determinants of susceptibility to COPD and emphysema in smokers, and its lung function was measured again after about three years.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23349703") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/201379/reporting") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/201379/reporting") Annotation(rdfs:comment "COPACETIC aims to unravel the genetic determinants of the susceptibility to develop chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD) in (ex-)smokers at high risk.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001622> "A cohort of male heavy smokers (at least 20 pack-years) aged 50–75, participants of the Dutch-Belgian NELSON lung cancer screening trial recruited by the University Medical Centers of Groningen and Utrecht in the Netherlands, with spirometry, low-dose chest CT and blood DNA and RNA. It was assembled and genotyped genome-wide as the discovery cohort of the European Union FP7 project COPACETIC, begun in 2008 under the coordination of UMC Utrecht, to find genetic determinants of susceptibility to COPD and emphysema in smokers, and its lung function was measured again after about three years.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23349703") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/201379/reporting") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/201379/reporting") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The Dutch Nelson cohort of 20 pack years (ex-)smokers delivered to the COPACETIC project pulmonary function tests / emphysema estimates, next to DNA / RNA samples.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001622> "A cohort of male heavy smokers (at least 20 pack-years) aged 50–75, participants of the Dutch-Belgian NELSON lung cancer screening trial recruited by the University Medical Centers of Groningen and Utrecht in the Netherlands, with spirometry, low-dose chest CT and blood DNA and RNA. It was assembled and genotyped genome-wide as the discovery cohort of the European Union FP7 project COPACETIC, begun in 2008 under the coordination of UMC Utrecht, to find genetic determinants of susceptibility to COPD and emphysema in smokers, and its lung function was measured again after about three years.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23349703") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/201379/reporting") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/201379/reporting") Annotation(rdfs:comment "They included the same type of heavy smoker of similar age, measured the same parameters as in the Nelson study (low dose CT-scan / spirometry / blood samples for DNA).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001622> "A cohort of male heavy smokers (at least 20 pack-years) aged 50–75, participants of the Dutch-Belgian NELSON lung cancer screening trial recruited by the University Medical Centers of Groningen and Utrecht in the Netherlands, with spirometry, low-dose chest CT and blood DNA and RNA. It was assembled and genotyped genome-wide as the discovery cohort of the European Union FP7 project COPACETIC, begun in 2008 under the coordination of UMC Utrecht, to find genetic determinants of susceptibility to COPD and emphysema in smokers, and its lung function was measured again after about three years.")

