AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28604730") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32393777") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:28604730") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Cases were diagnosed histologically from 2012 and onwards with treatable lung cancer.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001624> "A hospital-based lung cancer case–control study in Copenhagen, Denmark, whose cases are patients diagnosed histologically with treatable lung cancer from 2012 onwards (recruited 2012–2013) and whose controls are participants of the Copenhagen General Population Study without lung cancer; it was genotyped in the lung cancer OncoArray project of the International Lung Cancer Consortium for studies of genetic susceptibility to lung cancer.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28604730") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32393777") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:28604730") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Controls were participants of the Copenhagen General Population Study without lung cancer.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001624> "A hospital-based lung cancer case–control study in Copenhagen, Denmark, whose cases are patients diagnosed histologically with treatable lung cancer from 2012 onwards (recruited 2012–2013) and whose controls are participants of the Copenhagen General Population Study without lung cancer; it was genotyped in the lung cancer OncoArray project of the International Lung Cancer Consortium for studies of genetic susceptibility to lung cancer.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28604730") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32393777") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:28604730") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Denmark Hosp.CC 2004 (controls) 2012-2013 (cases) 657 1460 2117") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001624> "A hospital-based lung cancer case–control study in Copenhagen, Denmark, whose cases are patients diagnosed histologically with treatable lung cancer from 2012 onwards (recruited 2012–2013) and whose controls are participants of the Copenhagen General Population Study without lung cancer; it was genotyped in the lung cancer OncoArray project of the International Lung Cancer Consortium for studies of genetic susceptibility to lung cancer.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28604730") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32393777") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:28604730") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5510465/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "This work is conducted based on the collaboration of Transdisciplinary Research of Cancer in Lung of the International Lung Cancer Consortium (TRICL-ILCCO) and the Lung Cancer Cohort Consortium (LC3).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001624> "A hospital-based lung cancer case–control study in Copenhagen, Denmark, whose cases are patients diagnosed histologically with treatable lung cancer from 2012 onwards (recruited 2012–2013) and whose controls are participants of the Copenhagen General Population Study without lung cancer; it was genotyped in the lung cancer OncoArray project of the International Lung Cancer Consortium for studies of genetic susceptibility to lung cancer.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28604730") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32393777") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:28604730") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5510465/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "With the goal of conducting a comprehensive characterization of common lung cancer genetic susceptibility loci, we undertook additional genotyping of lung cancer cases and controls using the OncoArray5 genotyping platform, which queried 517,482 SNPs chosen for fine mapping of susceptibility to common cancers as well as for de novo discovery (Supplementary Table 1, and Online Methods).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001624> "A hospital-based lung cancer case–control study in Copenhagen, Denmark, whose cases are patients diagnosed histologically with treatable lung cancer from 2012 onwards (recruited 2012–2013) and whose controls are participants of the Copenhagen General Population Study without lung cancer; it was genotyped in the lung cancer OncoArray project of the International Lung Cancer Consortium for studies of genetic susceptibility to lung cancer.")

