AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21206424") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23879408") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:30801552") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32080893") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23879408") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3787982/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "3,402 kidney or simultaneous kidney-pancreas transplant (SPK) recipients in 5 U.S. and 2 Canadian transplant centers were consented and enrolled at the time of transplantation in the DeKAF Genomics, a prospective observational, study between 2006 and 2011.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001655> "A prospective observational cohort of kidney and simultaneous pancreas–kidney transplant recipients enrolled at the time of transplantation between 2005 and 2011 at five US and two Canadian transplant centres, the genetic study of the prospective arm of the Long-term Deterioration of Kidney Allograft Function (DeKAF) study, which with DNA from the recipients and from their living or deceased donors studies genetic influences on acute rejection, graft failure and immunosuppressant concentrations and adverse effects.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21206424") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23879408") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:30801552") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32080893") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:30801552") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6597284/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The design of the discovery cohort, (DeKAF Genomics from 7 enrolling centers, transplanted from 2005 to 2011, www.clinicaltrials.gov NCT00270712) along with cohort characteristics has been previously reported.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001655> "A prospective observational cohort of kidney and simultaneous pancreas–kidney transplant recipients enrolled at the time of transplantation between 2005 and 2011 at five US and two Canadian transplant centres, the genetic study of the prospective arm of the Long-term Deterioration of Kidney Allograft Function (DeKAF) study, which with DNA from the recipients and from their living or deceased donors studies genetic influences on acute rejection, graft failure and immunosuppressant concentrations and adverse effects.")
