AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21206424") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23879408") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:30801552") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32080893") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:38820342") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC11142483/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The DeKAF Genomics cohort and GEN-03 cohorts (Table 1) contained 784 and 352 living donor-recipient pairs, respectively.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001655> "A prospective observational cohort of kidney and simultaneous pancreas–kidney transplant recipients enrolled at the time of transplantation between 2005 and 2011 at five US and two Canadian transplant centres, the genetic study of the prospective arm of the Long-term Deterioration of Kidney Allograft Function (DeKAF) study, which with DNA from the recipients and from their living or deceased donors studies genetic influences on acute rejection, graft failure and immunosuppressant concentrations and adverse effects.")

