AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23535729") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:25855707") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23535729") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2563/MediaObjects/41588_2013_BFng2563_MOESM7_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "DEMOKRITOS, NBHS_TN, OSU and RPCI were additional non-BCAC studies included as part of the TNBCC.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001656> "A Greek breast cancer case-control study conducted in collaboration with the Hellenic Cooperative Oncology Group, in which triple-negative breast cancer cases were enrolled from 1997 to 2010 in hospitals serving Athens, Thessaloniki, Ioannina, Patras and Chania (Crete), with population-based unaffected women of the same age range from Athens as controls; it contributed to the Triple Negative Breast Cancer Consortium.")
