AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:24092820") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:24296977") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:24092820") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3875855/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The Depression Genes and Networks cohort is comprised of individuals of European ancestry within the United States.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001658> "A United States case-control study of major depressive disorder whose participants, adults of European ancestry aged 21 to 60 with recurrent or chronic major depressive disorder and controls who had never had a depressive episode, were recruited by a survey research company from a nationally representative survey research panel, assessed by online screening and telephone interview, genotyped genome-wide and profiled by RNA sequencing of whole blood.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:24092820") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:24296977") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:24092820") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3875855/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The recruitment procedure of the Depression Genes and Networks study (National Institute of Mental Health Grant 5RC2MH089916) was designed to collect samples of individuals with and without major depressive disorder, ages 21–60, from a survey research panel that was broadly representative of the United States population (Supplemental Material).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001658> "A United States case-control study of major depressive disorder whose participants, adults of European ancestry aged 21 to 60 with recurrent or chronic major depressive disorder and controls who had never had a depressive episode, were recruited by a survey research company from a nationally representative survey research panel, assessed by online screening and telephone interview, genotyped genome-wide and profiled by RNA sequencing of whole blood.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:24092820") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:24296977") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:24092820") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3875855/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "We have sequenced RNA from whole blood of 922 genotyped individuals from the Depression Genes and Networks cohort (Methods), all of European ancestry.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001658> "A United States case-control study of major depressive disorder whose participants, adults of European ancestry aged 21 to 60 with recurrent or chronic major depressive disorder and controls who had never had a depressive episode, were recruited by a survey research company from a nationally representative survey research panel, assessed by online screening and telephone interview, genotyped genome-wide and profiled by RNA sequencing of whole blood.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:24092820") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:24296977") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:24296977") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5404932/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "After exclusions for substance dependence, non-affective psychosis and bipolar disorder, we identified 475 cases with MDD with two or more lifetime episodes or one episode lasting ≥ 2 years, and 474 controls who never experienced a two-week period with depressed mood plus 2 or more other MDD criteria.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001658> "A United States case-control study of major depressive disorder whose participants, adults of European ancestry aged 21 to 60 with recurrent or chronic major depressive disorder and controls who had never had a depressive episode, were recruited by a survey research company from a nationally representative survey research panel, assessed by online screening and telephone interview, genotyped genome-wide and profiled by RNA sequencing of whole blood.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:24092820") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:24296977") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:24296977") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5404932/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Cases (recurrent or chronic MDD) and controls were recruited by Knowledge Networks, Inc.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001658> "A United States case-control study of major depressive disorder whose participants, adults of European ancestry aged 21 to 60 with recurrent or chronic major depressive disorder and controls who had never had a depressive episode, were recruited by a survey research company from a nationally representative survey research panel, assessed by online screening and telephone interview, genotyped genome-wide and profiled by RNA sequencing of whole blood.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:24092820") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:24296977") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:24296977") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC5404932/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Respondents were screened online with lifetime self-report versions of the depression and alcohol/substance dependence modules of the Composite International Diagnostic Interview-Short Form (CIDI-SF) (10) plus screening items for psychotic and bipolar disorders.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001658> "A United States case-control study of major depressive disorder whose participants, adults of European ancestry aged 21 to 60 with recurrent or chronic major depressive disorder and controls who had never had a depressive episode, were recruited by a survey research company from a nationally representative survey research panel, assessed by online screening and telephone interview, genotyped genome-wide and profiled by RNA sequencing of whole blood.")

