AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:18753146") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23029024") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:18753146") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A18753146+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The common single-nucleotide polymorphism (SNP) rs3802842 at 11q23.1 has recently been reported to be associated with risk of colorectal cancer (CRC).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001661> "A Dutch colorectal cancer case-control series, whose cases had a family history of cancer and whose controls were population-based, that was one of the eight case-control series genotyped for the 11q23.1 risk variant rs3802842 in a 2008 study of colorectal cancer risk.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:18753146") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23029024") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:18753146") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A18753146+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "To examine this association in detail we genotyped rs3802842 in eight independent case-control series comprising a total of 10 638 cases and 10 457 healthy individuals.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001661> "A Dutch colorectal cancer case-control series, whose cases had a family history of cancer and whose controls were population-based, that was one of the eight case-control series genotyped for the 11q23.1 risk variant rs3802842 in a 2008 study of colorectal cancer risk.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:18753146") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23029024") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23029024") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3445543/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Pittman AM (DFCCS) 2008 Netherlands European Replication KASPar 783/664 0.90 53.4 (13.4) Yes 0.61 51.1 (11.3) Population based") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001661> "A Dutch colorectal cancer case-control series, whose cases had a family history of cancer and whose controls were population-based, that was one of the eight case-control series genotyped for the 11q23.1 risk variant rs3802842 in a 2008 study of colorectal cancer risk.")

