AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35939299") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:37461090") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:37960242") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:38728232") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:35939299") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9361078/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Both studies are open cohorts (details shown in eFigure 1 in the Supplement) and were conducted in 2 large state-owned corporations the Dongfeng Motor Corporation (DMC), one of the largest auto manufacturers in Shiyan City of central China; and the Kailuan Company, one of the largest colliery companies in Tangshan City of northern China.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001664> "A prospective cohort of retired employees of the Dongfeng Motor Corporation, a large state-owned car manufacturer in Shiyan, Hubei province, China, who completed questionnaires, medical examinations and blood sampling at a baseline survey in 2008–2010; further retirees were recruited at the first follow-up survey in 2013, and participants are re-surveyed about every five years.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35939299") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:37461090") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:37960242") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:38728232") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:37461090") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10353119/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "This study was based on the prospective Dongfeng–Tongji cohort, which was launched in 2008 with follow-up every five years.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001664> "A prospective cohort of retired employees of the Dongfeng Motor Corporation, a large state-owned car manufacturer in Shiyan, Hubei province, China, who completed questionnaires, medical examinations and blood sampling at a baseline survey in 2008–2010; further retirees were recruited at the first follow-up survey in 2013, and participants are re-surveyed about every five years.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35939299") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:37461090") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:37960242") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:38728232") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:37960242") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10650607/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "DFTJ was launched in 2008, and 27,009 retired employees from Dongfeng Motor Corporation were recruited and completed baseline questionnaires and medical examinations between September 2008 and June 2010.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001664> "A prospective cohort of retired employees of the Dongfeng Motor Corporation, a large state-owned car manufacturer in Shiyan, Hubei province, China, who completed questionnaires, medical examinations and blood sampling at a baseline survey in 2008–2010; further retirees were recruited at the first follow-up survey in 2013, and participants are re-surveyed about every five years.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35939299") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:37461090") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:37960242") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:38728232") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:37960242") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10650607/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "During the first follow-up in 2013, 14,120 retired workers were newly recruited, consequently, there was a total number of 41,129 participants with baseline information.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001664> "A prospective cohort of retired employees of the Dongfeng Motor Corporation, a large state-owned car manufacturer in Shiyan, Hubei province, China, who completed questionnaires, medical examinations and blood sampling at a baseline survey in 2008–2010; further retirees were recruited at the first follow-up survey in 2013, and participants are re-surveyed about every five years.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35939299") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:37461090") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:37960242") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:38728232") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:37960242") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10650607/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The Dongfeng-Tongji (DFTJ) cohort study is an ongoing prospective cohort, and detailed information has been described elsewhere [14].") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001664> "A prospective cohort of retired employees of the Dongfeng Motor Corporation, a large state-owned car manufacturer in Shiyan, Hubei province, China, who completed questionnaires, medical examinations and blood sampling at a baseline survey in 2008–2010; further retirees were recruited at the first follow-up survey in 2013, and participants are re-surveyed about every five years.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35939299") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:37461090") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:37960242") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:38728232") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:38728232") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11208759/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "In brief, 27,009 retired employees derived from Dongfeng Motor Corporation (DMC) completed the baseline survey from September 2008 to June 2010 in Shiyan City of Hubei province in China.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001664> "A prospective cohort of retired employees of the Dongfeng Motor Corporation, a large state-owned car manufacturer in Shiyan, Hubei province, China, who completed questionnaires, medical examinations and blood sampling at a baseline survey in 2008–2010; further retirees were recruited at the first follow-up survey in 2013, and participants are re-surveyed about every five years.")

