AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20453838") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20512659") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:25855707") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:20512659") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3632835/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Cases were unrelated individuals with breast cancer and a family history of breast cancer that were recruited through cancer genetics clinics in the UK, through the Genetics of Familial Breast Cancer Study.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001718> "A study coordinated from the Institute of Cancer Research, Sutton, that from 1995 recruited people with breast cancer and a family history of the disease, as the index cases of their families, through cancer genetics clinics throughout the United Kingdom, whose clinicians and counsellors formed the Breast Cancer Susceptibility Collaboration (UK), for research into inherited susceptibility to breast cancer.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20453838") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20512659") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:25855707") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:20512659") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3632835/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "In order to investigate formally the contribution of GEN1 to breast cancer susceptibility, we have undertaken mutational analysis of the full gene in 192 breast cancer cases and 184 controls") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001718> "A study coordinated from the Institute of Cancer Research, Sutton, that from 1995 recruited people with breast cancer and a family history of the disease, as the index cases of their families, through cancer genetics clinics throughout the United Kingdom, whose clinicians and counsellors formed the Breast Cancer Susceptibility Collaboration (UK), for research into inherited susceptibility to breast cancer.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20453838") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20512659") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:25855707") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:20512659") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3632835/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The authors gratefully acknowledge the clinicians and counsellors from the Breast Cancer Susceptibility Collaboration UK (BCSC) who coordinated recruitment and collection of the FBCS samples") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001718> "A study coordinated from the Institute of Cancer Research, Sutton, that from 1995 recruited people with breast cancer and a family history of the disease, as the index cases of their families, through cancer genetics clinics throughout the United Kingdom, whose clinicians and counsellors formed the Breast Cancer Susceptibility Collaboration (UK), for research into inherited susceptibility to breast cancer.")
