AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23143601") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23143601") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2456/MediaObjects/41588_2012_BFng2456_MOESM34_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Cases and controls were from four hospitals, including the Shanghai Changhai Hospital, the Jiangsu Taizhou People's Hospital, the Zhongshan Hospital Fudan University, and the Shanghai Chest Hospital.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001733> "A hospital-based case-control study of lung cancer in ethnic Chinese in the Shanghai area of China, whose cases were patients presenting with primary lung cancer and whose controls were patients diagnosed with diseases unrelated to any cancer at four hospitals (Shanghai Changhai Hospital, Jiangsu Taizhou People's Hospital, Zhongshan Hospital of Fudan University and Shanghai Chest Hospital); it is one of the studies pooled in the Female Lung Cancer Consortium in Asia.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23143601") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23143601") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2456/MediaObjects/41588_2012_BFng2456_MOESM34_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Cases were patients who presented to these hospitals with primary lung cancer.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001733> "A hospital-based case-control study of lung cancer in ethnic Chinese in the Shanghai area of China, whose cases were patients presenting with primary lung cancer and whose controls were patients diagnosed with diseases unrelated to any cancer at four hospitals (Shanghai Changhai Hospital, Jiangsu Taizhou People's Hospital, Zhongshan Hospital of Fudan University and Shanghai Chest Hospital); it is one of the studies pooled in the Female Lung Cancer Consortium in Asia.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23143601") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23143601") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2456/MediaObjects/41588_2012_BFng2456_MOESM34_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Controls were patients of these hospitals that were diagnosed with diseases unrelated to any cancer.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001733> "A hospital-based case-control study of lung cancer in ethnic Chinese in the Shanghai area of China, whose cases were patients presenting with primary lung cancer and whose controls were patients diagnosed with diseases unrelated to any cancer at four hospitals (Shanghai Changhai Hospital, Jiangsu Taizhou People's Hospital, Zhongshan Hospital of Fudan University and Shanghai Chest Hospital); it is one of the studies pooled in the Female Lung Cancer Consortium in Asia.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23143601") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23143601") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2456/MediaObjects/41588_2012_BFng2456_MOESM34_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The FLCS enrolled cases and controls from four hospitals in the Shanghai area of China.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001733> "A hospital-based case-control study of lung cancer in ethnic Chinese in the Shanghai area of China, whose cases were patients presenting with primary lung cancer and whose controls were patients diagnosed with diseases unrelated to any cancer at four hospitals (Shanghai Changhai Hospital, Jiangsu Taizhou People's Hospital, Zhongshan Hospital of Fudan University and Shanghai Chest Hospital); it is one of the studies pooled in the Female Lung Cancer Consortium in Asia.")
