AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23143601") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23143601") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4169232/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "To gain insight into the etiology of lung cancer among never-smoking women, we formed the Female Lung Cancer Consortium in Asia (FLCCA), which includes studies drawn from mainland China, South Korea, Japan, Singapore, Taiwan, and Hong Kong.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001733> "A hospital-based case-control study of lung cancer in ethnic Chinese in the Shanghai area of China, whose cases were patients presenting with primary lung cancer and whose controls were patients diagnosed with diseases unrelated to any cancer at four hospitals (Shanghai Changhai Hospital, Jiangsu Taizhou People's Hospital, Zhongshan Hospital of Fudan University and Shanghai Chest Hospital); it is one of the studies pooled in the Female Lung Cancer Consortium in Asia.")

