# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001852> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001852>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:17617932") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:19011652") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23148760") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:25609179") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:25609179") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4334414/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "A multi-stage random cluster sampling procedure was used to select 3528 adolescents, stratified by geographical location, age and socioeconomic status (SES).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001852> "A multicentre cross-sectional study of adolescents aged 12.5 to 17.5 years in ten European cities (Stockholm, Athens, Heraklion, Rome, Zaragoza, Ghent, Lille, Dortmund, Vienna and Pecs), carried out from October 2006 to December 2007 within the European Union-funded HELENA project, which selected adolescents through randomly chosen schools by multi-stage random cluster sampling stratified by geographical location, age and socioeconomic status, and measured diet, physical activity, fitness and body composition with harmonised methods, with fasting blood samples from a randomly selected subsample, to describe the nutritional status and lifestyle of European adolescents.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:17617932") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:19011652") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23148760") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:25609179") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:25609179") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4334414/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Blood samples were collected in a randomly selected subsample of the total HELENA-CSS.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001852> "A multicentre cross-sectional study of adolescents aged 12.5 to 17.5 years in ten European cities (Stockholm, Athens, Heraklion, Rome, Zaragoza, Ghent, Lille, Dortmund, Vienna and Pecs), carried out from October 2006 to December 2007 within the European Union-funded HELENA project, which selected adolescents through randomly chosen schools by multi-stage random cluster sampling stratified by geographical location, age and socioeconomic status, and measured diet, physical activity, fitness and body composition with harmonised methods, with fasting blood samples from a randomly selected subsample, to describe the nutritional status and lifestyle of European adolescents.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:17617932") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:19011652") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23148760") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:25609179") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:25609179") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4334414/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Fasting blood samples, information of adolescents’ medical history and recent acute diseases were collected by venipuncture between 8–10 a.m. at schools or hospitals by a medical doctor") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001852> "A multicentre cross-sectional study of adolescents aged 12.5 to 17.5 years in ten European cities (Stockholm, Athens, Heraklion, Rome, Zaragoza, Ghent, Lille, Dortmund, Vienna and Pecs), carried out from October 2006 to December 2007 within the European Union-funded HELENA project, which selected adolescents through randomly chosen schools by multi-stage random cluster sampling stratified by geographical location, age and socioeconomic status, and measured diet, physical activity, fitness and body composition with harmonised methods, with fasting blood samples from a randomly selected subsample, to describe the nutritional status and lifestyle of European adolescents.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:17617932") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:19011652") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23148760") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:25609179") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:25609179") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4334414/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Male and female adolescents, aged 12.5-17.5 y") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001852> "A multicentre cross-sectional study of adolescents aged 12.5 to 17.5 years in ten European cities (Stockholm, Athens, Heraklion, Rome, Zaragoza, Ghent, Lille, Dortmund, Vienna and Pecs), carried out from October 2006 to December 2007 within the European Union-funded HELENA project, which selected adolescents through randomly chosen schools by multi-stage random cluster sampling stratified by geographical location, age and socioeconomic status, and measured diet, physical activity, fitness and body composition with harmonised methods, with fasting blood samples from a randomly selected subsample, to describe the nutritional status and lifestyle of European adolescents.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:17617932") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:19011652") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23148760") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:25609179") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:25609179") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4334414/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Schools were randomly selected after stratification to guarantee diversity of the sample in culture and SES.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001852> "A multicentre cross-sectional study of adolescents aged 12.5 to 17.5 years in ten European cities (Stockholm, Athens, Heraklion, Rome, Zaragoza, Ghent, Lille, Dortmund, Vienna and Pecs), carried out from October 2006 to December 2007 within the European Union-funded HELENA project, which selected adolescents through randomly chosen schools by multi-stage random cluster sampling stratified by geographical location, age and socioeconomic status, and measured diet, physical activity, fitness and body composition with harmonised methods, with fasting blood samples from a randomly selected subsample, to describe the nutritional status and lifestyle of European adolescents.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:17617932") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:19011652") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23148760") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:25609179") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:25609179") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4334414/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The Healthy Lifestyle in Europe by Nutrition in Adolescence-Cross Sectional Study (HELENA-CSS) is a European Commission funded project on lifestyle and nutrition among adolescents from 10 cities of European countries: Stockholm, Athens, Heraklion, Rome, Zaragoza, Ghent, Lille, Dortmund,Vienna, and Pecs that ran between October 2006 and December 2007.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001852> "A multicentre cross-sectional study of adolescents aged 12.5 to 17.5 years in ten European cities (Stockholm, Athens, Heraklion, Rome, Zaragoza, Ghent, Lille, Dortmund, Vienna and Pecs), carried out from October 2006 to December 2007 within the European Union-funded HELENA project, which selected adolescents through randomly chosen schools by multi-stage random cluster sampling stratified by geographical location, age and socioeconomic status, and measured diet, physical activity, fitness and body composition with harmonised methods, with fasting blood samples from a randomly selected subsample, to describe the nutritional status and lifestyle of European adolescents.")

# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001853> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001853>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:24993387") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11817854/fullTextXML") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:24993387") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A24993387+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The HELIAD is a population-based, multidisciplinary, collaborative study designed to estimate the prevalence and incidence of AD, other dementias, mild cognitive impairment, and other neuropsychiatric conditions of aging in the Greek population") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001853> "A population-based, multidisciplinary longitudinal study of older adults in Greece, randomly selected at age 65 or over from the municipality registries of Marousi, a suburb of Athens, and of the city of Larissa and its rural surroundings, with baseline evaluations from 2011 to 2015 and follow-up evaluations thereafter, designed to estimate the prevalence and incidence of Alzheimer's disease, other dementias, mild cognitive impairment and other neuropsychiatric conditions of ageing and to study their associations with nutrition in this Mediterranean population.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:24993387") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11817854/fullTextXML") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:24993387") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A24993387+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "and to investigate associations between nutrition and cognitive dysfunction/age-related neuropsychiatric diseases in this Mediterranean population.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001853> "A population-based, multidisciplinary longitudinal study of older adults in Greece, randomly selected at age 65 or over from the municipality registries of Marousi, a suburb of Athens, and of the city of Larissa and its rural surroundings, with baseline evaluations from 2011 to 2015 and follow-up evaluations thereafter, designed to estimate the prevalence and incidence of Alzheimer's disease, other dementias, mild cognitive impairment and other neuropsychiatric conditions of ageing and to study their associations with nutrition in this Mediterranean population.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:24993387") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11817854/fullTextXML") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:39940679") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11817854/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Overall, 1986 individuals completed the baseline evaluation from 2011 to 2015, while 1226 participants completed the follow-up evaluation from 2013 to 2019.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001853> "A population-based, multidisciplinary longitudinal study of older adults in Greece, randomly selected at age 65 or over from the municipality registries of Marousi, a suburb of Athens, and of the city of Larissa and its rural surroundings, with baseline evaluations from 2011 to 2015 and follow-up evaluations thereafter, designed to estimate the prevalence and incidence of Alzheimer's disease, other dementias, mild cognitive impairment and other neuropsychiatric conditions of ageing and to study their associations with nutrition in this Mediterranean population.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:24993387") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11817854/fullTextXML") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:39940679") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11817854/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The recruitment process involved the random selection of individuals over 64 years old from an Athens suburb (Marousi) and the city of Larissa, as well as its rural surroundings, using local municipality registries.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001853> "A population-based, multidisciplinary longitudinal study of older adults in Greece, randomly selected at age 65 or over from the municipality registries of Marousi, a suburb of Athens, and of the city of Larissa and its rural surroundings, with baseline evaluations from 2011 to 2015 and follow-up evaluations thereafter, designed to estimate the prevalence and incidence of Alzheimer's disease, other dementias, mild cognitive impairment and other neuropsychiatric conditions of ageing and to study their associations with nutrition in this Mediterranean population.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:24993387") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11817854/fullTextXML") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:39940679") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC11817854/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The study participants were derived from the HELIAD study, which is an epidemiological study of aging in the elderly Greek population focusing on dementia and other neuropsychiatric disorders.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001853> "A population-based, multidisciplinary longitudinal study of older adults in Greece, randomly selected at age 65 or over from the municipality registries of Marousi, a suburb of Athens, and of the city of Larissa and its rural surroundings, with baseline evaluations from 2011 to 2015 and follow-up evaluations thereafter, designed to estimate the prevalence and incidence of Alzheimer's disease, other dementias, mild cognitive impairment and other neuropsychiatric conditions of ageing and to study their associations with nutrition in this Mediterranean population.")

