AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:19300482") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28170284") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:34855941") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-10") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "GPT-6 (OpenAI Codex), 2026-10") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:19300482") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://journals.plos.org/plosgenetics/article?id=10.1371/journal.pgen.1000421") Annotation(rdfs:comment "COPD is a heterogeneous disease and we used a spirometry-based definition for COPD in all of the populations.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001899> "A family-based study of chronic obstructive pulmonary disease funded by GlaxoSmithKline, whose pedigrees of probands with COPD and their siblings, characterised by spirometry, serve as a replication and testing cohort in COPD genome-wide association studies and genetic risk-score meta-analyses, including a 2017 meta-analysis.")
