# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001900> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001900>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26884359") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:41028956") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:26884359") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4756509/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "A total of 3,078 subjects were recruited following identification from local pathology reports in 97 UK hospitals.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001900> "A UK case-control study of genetic predisposition to ductal carcinoma in situ (DCIS) of the breast, which between 2007 and 2012 recruited women aged 60 or under with a current or past diagnosis of DCIS, identified from local pathology reports at more than 100 hospitals throughout the United Kingdom, and healthy controls without a family history of breast cancer (often friends or non-blood relatives of cases), with a blood sample and a questionnaire on reproductive, medical and family history and hormone use.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26884359") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:41028956") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:26884359") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4756509/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Patients aged 60 years or less at the time of diagnosis, with a current or past history of DCIS (without invasive disease of any histological subtype) were eligible.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001900> "A UK case-control study of genetic predisposition to ductal carcinoma in situ (DCIS) of the breast, which between 2007 and 2012 recruited women aged 60 or under with a current or past diagnosis of DCIS, identified from local pathology reports at more than 100 hospitals throughout the United Kingdom, and healthy controls without a family history of breast cancer (often friends or non-blood relatives of cases), with a blood sample and a questionnaire on reproductive, medical and family history and hormone use.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26884359") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:41028956") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:41028956") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12580823/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Cases and controls were recruited from more than 100 hospitals throughout the United Kingdom, and 3,136 DCIS cases were recruited to ICICLE, whereas 340 pure LCIS cases were recruited to GLACIER.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001900> "A UK case-control study of genetic predisposition to ductal carcinoma in situ (DCIS) of the breast, which between 2007 and 2012 recruited women aged 60 or under with a current or past diagnosis of DCIS, identified from local pathology reports at more than 100 hospitals throughout the United Kingdom, and healthy controls without a family history of breast cancer (often friends or non-blood relatives of cases), with a blood sample and a questionnaire on reproductive, medical and family history and hormone use.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26884359") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:41028956") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:41028956") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12580823/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Controls for GLACIER and ICICLE were often friends and nonblood relatives identified by cases and had to have no history of breast disease and no family history of breast cancer.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001900> "A UK case-control study of genetic predisposition to ductal carcinoma in situ (DCIS) of the breast, which between 2007 and 2012 recruited women aged 60 or under with a current or past diagnosis of DCIS, identified from local pathology reports at more than 100 hospitals throughout the United Kingdom, and healthy controls without a family history of breast cancer (often friends or non-blood relatives of cases), with a blood sample and a questionnaire on reproductive, medical and family history and hormone use.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26884359") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:41028956") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:41028956") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12580823/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Participants in the ICICLE and GLACIER studies were required to complete a questionnaire at study entry, which included questions on reproductive, medical, and family history and use of hormones such as the contraceptive pill or hormone replacement therapies.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001900> "A UK case-control study of genetic predisposition to ductal carcinoma in situ (DCIS) of the breast, which between 2007 and 2012 recruited women aged 60 or under with a current or past diagnosis of DCIS, identified from local pathology reports at more than 100 hospitals throughout the United Kingdom, and healthy controls without a family history of breast cancer (often friends or non-blood relatives of cases), with a blood sample and a questionnaire on reproductive, medical and family history and hormone use.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26884359") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:41028956") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:41028956") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC12580823/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The ICICLE study was a case–control study recruiting DCIS cases and healthy controls without a family history of breast cancer between 2007 and 2012") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001900> "A UK case-control study of genetic predisposition to ductal carcinoma in situ (DCIS) of the breast, which between 2007 and 2012 recruited women aged 60 or under with a current or past diagnosis of DCIS, identified from local pathology reports at more than 100 hospitals throughout the United Kingdom, and healthy controls without a family history of breast cancer (often friends or non-blood relatives of cases), with a blood sample and a questionnaire on reproductive, medical and family history and hormone use.")

