AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:41908051") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:8581794") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:8793366") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:9103091") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:41908051") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC13021488/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The ICSHIB base sample included more than 15,000 participants recruited from the Yoruba-speaking city of Ibadan and the town of Igbo-Ora in Oyo State, Nigeria.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001902> "A population-based survey of blood pressure, hypertension and associated risk factors such as obesity among adults of West African origin living in societies at different stages of social and economic development, which examined age-stratified samples at seven sites in Nigeria, Cameroon, Jamaica, St. Lucia, Barbados and metropolitan Chicago in the United States under a standardized protocol with centrally trained field staff; its Nigerian base sample, recruited in Ibadan and Igbo-Ora in Oyo State, later provided the sampling frame for genotyped cohorts.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:41908051") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:8581794") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:8793366") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:9103091") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:8581794") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A8581794+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "A survey of the prevalence of hypertension and associated risk factors including obesity was carried out among persons of West African heritage currently living in societies at different stages of social, economic and technological development.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001902> "A population-based survey of blood pressure, hypertension and associated risk factors such as obesity among adults of West African origin living in societies at different stages of social and economic development, which examined age-stratified samples at seven sites in Nigeria, Cameroon, Jamaica, St. Lucia, Barbados and metropolitan Chicago in the United States under a standardized protocol with centrally trained field staff; its Nigerian base sample, recruited in Ibadan and Igbo-Ora in Oyo State, later provided the sampling frame for genotyped cohorts.")
