AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:19525953") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21654844") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:21654844") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/research/bionlp/RESTful/pmcoa.cgi/BioC_xml/PMC3640650/unicode") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The MS subjects were recruited from three clinical sites: 453 cases from the UK (IMSGC UK) and 342 cases from the US (IMSGC US); the remaining 860 MS patients were recruited at Partners MS Center in Boston, MA (BWH).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001915> "A UK case-control sample of the International Multiple Sclerosis Genetics Consortium, comprising patients with multiple sclerosis (McDonald criteria) of European descent recruited in the United Kingdom and healthy control subjects from the Wellcome Trust Case Control Consortium, genotyped on the Affymetrix 500K platform and used as one stratum of the consortium's genome-wide association meta-analyses.")
