AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:22282543") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:22282543") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3283533/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "A randomized, double-blind placebo-controlled trial was conducted from December 27, 2007, to May 13, 2010.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001965> "A randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled clinical trial (NCT00666978), conducted from December 2007 to May 2010 at an urban community-based clinic in Kansas City, Missouri, of sustained-release bupropion combined with health education counselling for smoking cessation in African American light smokers (10 or fewer cigarettes per day) aged 18 or older; the third of the Kick It at Swope trials.")
