# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001987> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001987>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31226226") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:38014910") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41391-020-00311-2/MediaObjects/41391_2020_311_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-018-0142-8/MediaObjects/41588_2018_142_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5448553/supplementaryFiles") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:31226226") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7028127/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Controls (n = 331) were Latino men without PrCa diagnosis and were frequency matched with cases on age (±5 years), who were identified via a neighborhood walk algorithm.18") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001987> "A population-based case-control study of aggressive prostate cancer in Los Angeles County, California, run from the University of Southern California, whose cases were identified through the Los Angeles County Cancer Surveillance Program and whose controls, men without prostate cancer frequency-matched to cases on age, were identified by a neighbourhood walk algorithm, with some controls drawn from the Multiethnic Cohort; it includes men of European, Latino and African ancestry.")
