AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:19706757") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21750109") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:19706757") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC2782435/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "In this study we present results from meta- and pooled analyses conducted as part of the International Consortium of Bladder Cancer.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0001990> "A hospital-based case-control study of bladder cancer in Leeds, England, whose cases were patients of the urology department of St James's University Hospital and whose controls came from the hospital's otolaryngology and ophthalmology departments, recruited from August 2002 to March 2006. It takes part in the International Consortium of Bladder Cancer.")
