AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20972438") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21750109") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:20972438") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.687/MediaObjects/41588_2010_BFng687_MOESM14_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Lutherstadt Wittenberg Bladder Cancer Study (LWBCS) 217 200 Hospital-based case-control, Germany") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002024> "A hospital-based case–control study of bladder cancer in Lutherstadt Wittenberg, Germany, whose cases were patients with confirmed bladder cancer enrolled at the Department of Urology of the Paul Gerhardt Foundation from 1995 to 1999 and whose controls were patients of the same department admitted for benign urological diseases and enrolled from 2000 to 2005; occupational history, exposure to occupational bladder carcinogens, smoking and family history of bladder cancer were documented for cases and controls.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20972438") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21750109") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:21750109") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3188988/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "A total of 214 controls were from the same Department of Urology, but were admitted for treatment of benign urological diseases.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002024> "A hospital-based case–control study of bladder cancer in Lutherstadt Wittenberg, Germany, whose cases were patients with confirmed bladder cancer enrolled at the Department of Urology of the Paul Gerhardt Foundation from 1995 to 1999 and whose controls were patients of the same department admitted for benign urological diseases and enrolled from 2000 to 2005; occupational history, exposure to occupational bladder carcinogens, smoking and family history of bladder cancer were documented for cases and controls.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20972438") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21750109") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:21750109") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3188988/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Data collected in cases and controls include age, gender, a complete documentation of occupational activities performed at least for 6 months, documentation of work places with known bladder cancer risk over the entire working life, exposures to known or suspected occupational bladder carcinogens, lifetime smoking habits, family history of bladder cancer,") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002024> "A hospital-based case–control study of bladder cancer in Lutherstadt Wittenberg, Germany, whose cases were patients with confirmed bladder cancer enrolled at the Department of Urology of the Paul Gerhardt Foundation from 1995 to 1999 and whose controls were patients of the same department admitted for benign urological diseases and enrolled from 2000 to 2005; occupational history, exposure to occupational bladder carcinogens, smoking and family history of bladder cancer were documented for cases and controls.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20972438") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21750109") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:21750109") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3188988/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Data were collected from July 2000 to May 2005.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002024> "A hospital-based case–control study of bladder cancer in Lutherstadt Wittenberg, Germany, whose cases were patients with confirmed bladder cancer enrolled at the Department of Urology of the Paul Gerhardt Foundation from 1995 to 1999 and whose controls were patients of the same department admitted for benign urological diseases and enrolled from 2000 to 2005; occupational history, exposure to occupational bladder carcinogens, smoking and family history of bladder cancer were documented for cases and controls.")
