# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002057> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002057>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31030672") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:31030672") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6486953/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "All serum samples were kept frozen until processed in a central laboratory certified by the External Comparative Evaluation of Laboratories Program of the College of American Pathologists (Departamento de Endocrinología y Metabolismo, Instituto Nacional de Ciencias Médicas y Nutrición, México City).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002057> "A prospective observational cohort of apparently healthy adults aged 20 or over whose parents and grandparents were born in Mexico, recruited from 2007 to 2011 at workplaces, homes and medical units in urban centres of central Mexico (Mexico City, Aguascalientes, León, Toluca and Cuernavaca) and re-examined about three years later, to study the incidence of type 2 diabetes, hypertension and cardiovascular disease; its samples are processed centrally at the Instituto Nacional de Ciencias Médicas y Nutrición in Mexico City.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31030672") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:31030672") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6486953/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Clinical data and blood samples were obtained from 10,052 individuals at baseline from 2007 to 2011.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002057> "A prospective observational cohort of apparently healthy adults aged 20 or over whose parents and grandparents were born in Mexico, recruited from 2007 to 2011 at workplaces, homes and medical units in urban centres of central Mexico (Mexico City, Aguascalientes, León, Toluca and Cuernavaca) and re-examined about three years later, to study the incidence of type 2 diabetes, hypertension and cardiovascular disease; its samples are processed centrally at the Instituto Nacional de Ciencias Médicas y Nutrición in Mexico City.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31030672") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:31030672") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6486953/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Participants were identified and evaluated at their workplaces (offices of the federal government or private companies) (n = 3246), homes (n = 189) or during a visit of a relative to a medical unit (n = 2709).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002057> "A prospective observational cohort of apparently healthy adults aged 20 or over whose parents and grandparents were born in Mexico, recruited from 2007 to 2011 at workplaces, homes and medical units in urban centres of central Mexico (Mexico City, Aguascalientes, León, Toluca and Cuernavaca) and re-examined about three years later, to study the incidence of type 2 diabetes, hypertension and cardiovascular disease; its samples are processed centrally at the Instituto Nacional de Ciencias Médicas y Nutrición in Mexico City.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31030672") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:31030672") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6486953/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The study sample was composed by apparently-healthy adults ≥20 years, with BMI ≥20 kg/m2, who resided for > 6 months in the evaluated city, and without plans to move to other city in the short term, whose grandparents and parents were born in Mexico.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002057> "A prospective observational cohort of apparently healthy adults aged 20 or over whose parents and grandparents were born in Mexico, recruited from 2007 to 2011 at workplaces, homes and medical units in urban centres of central Mexico (Mexico City, Aguascalientes, León, Toluca and Cuernavaca) and re-examined about three years later, to study the incidence of type 2 diabetes, hypertension and cardiovascular disease; its samples are processed centrally at the Instituto Nacional de Ciencias Médicas y Nutrición in Mexico City.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31030672") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:31030672") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6486953/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "We performed a prospective observational cohort study including Mexican adults living in large urban settings of central Mexico including Mexico City, Cuernavaca, Leon, Toluca and Aguascalientes to evaluate incidence of T2D, arterial hypertension and cardiovascular disease") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002057> "A prospective observational cohort of apparently healthy adults aged 20 or over whose parents and grandparents were born in Mexico, recruited from 2007 to 2011 at workplaces, homes and medical units in urban centres of central Mexico (Mexico City, Aguascalientes, León, Toluca and Cuernavaca) and re-examined about three years later, to study the incidence of type 2 diabetes, hypertension and cardiovascular disease; its samples are processed centrally at the Instituto Nacional de Ciencias Médicas y Nutrición in Mexico City.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31030672") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:31030672") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A31030672+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Prospective 3-year observational cohort, comprised of apparently-healthy adults from urban settings of central Mexico in whom demographic, anthropometric and biochemical data was collected.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002057> "A prospective observational cohort of apparently healthy adults aged 20 or over whose parents and grandparents were born in Mexico, recruited from 2007 to 2011 at workplaces, homes and medical units in urban centres of central Mexico (Mexico City, Aguascalientes, León, Toluca and Cuernavaca) and re-examined about three years later, to study the incidence of type 2 diabetes, hypertension and cardiovascular disease; its samples are processed centrally at the Instituto Nacional de Ciencias Médicas y Nutrición in Mexico City.")

