AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20385819") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/study.cgi?study_id=phs000182.v3.p1") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-10") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "GPT-6 (OpenAI Codex), 2026-10") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/study.cgi?study_id=phs000182.v3.p1") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Through this collaborative effort, we submitted and obtained usable genotyping data on 2185 patients and 1155 controls from the Center for Inherited Disease Research (CIDR).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002072> "A case-control collection for a joint genome-wide association study of age-related macular degeneration, assembled by researchers from the University of Michigan, the Mayo Clinic, the University of Pennsylvania and the Age-Related Eye Disease Study group with National Eye Institute intramural investigators, who contributed patients with macular degeneration characterised by geographic atrophy, neovascularisation or large drusen and examined unaffected controls enrolled from 1998 through ophthalmology clinics in Michigan, Pennsylvania, Minnesota and Texas and through the Age-Related Eye Disease Study, genotyped together at the Center for Inherited Disease Research.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20385819") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/study.cgi?study_id=phs000182.v3.p1") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-10") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "GPT-6 (OpenAI Codex), 2026-10") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/projects/gap/cgi-bin/study.cgi?study_id=phs000182.v3.p1") Annotation(rdfs:comment "We have assembled a collaborative group of researchers from the University of Michigan, Mayo Clinic, University of Pennsylvania, and the AREDS group including National Eye Institute intramural investigators, who collected clinical data and DNA from a large number of patients affected with AMD and from unaffected controls.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002072> "A case-control collection for a joint genome-wide association study of age-related macular degeneration, assembled by researchers from the University of Michigan, the Mayo Clinic, the University of Pennsylvania and the Age-Related Eye Disease Study group with National Eye Institute intramural investigators, who contributed patients with macular degeneration characterised by geographic atrophy, neovascularisation or large drusen and examined unaffected controls enrolled from 1998 through ophthalmology clinics in Michigan, Pennsylvania, Minnesota and Texas and through the Age-Related Eye Disease Study, genotyped together at the Center for Inherited Disease Research.")

