AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20641046") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35913550") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:42687372") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:9555130") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:9857790") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:9857790") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A9857790+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The article describes the objectives and design of a prospective study of the prevalence, incidence and course of psychiatric disorders in a representative sample of non-institutionalized Dutch adults.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002134> "A psychiatric epidemiological population study of non-institutionalised Dutch adults, conducted by the Trimbos Institute in Utrecht, that interviews representative samples drawn by multistage, stratified random sampling (NEMESIS-1 from 1996 and NEMESIS-2 from 2007, aged 18-64, the latter with DNA from saliva, and NEMESIS-3 from 2019, aged 18-75) with the Composite International Diagnostic Interview and follows them up to determine the prevalence, incidence, course and consequences of mental disorders.")

