AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21750109") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:21750109") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3188988/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The ongoing case–control series consists of 217 bladder cancer cases and 105 controls from the Department of Urology, Lukasklinik Neuss, Germany, located ∼20 km from the Ruhr area.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002138> "An ongoing hospital-based case-control study of urinary bladder cancer at the Department of Urology of the Lukasklinik Neuss, Germany, about 20 km from the Ruhr area, which from June 2009 collected bladder cancer patients, with tumour stage and grade from the cancer registry, and cancer-free controls.")

