AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29494586") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31743460") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40608839") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:29494586") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5849325/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The NFOAS recruited OA patients who underwent a total knee replacement surgery due to primary OA between November 2011 and December 2013 at the St. Clare’s Mercy Hospital and Health Science Centre General Hospital in St. John’s, the capital city of Newfoundland and Labrador (NL), Canada.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002140> "A study initiated in 2011 that consecutively recruited, until 2017, patients undergoing total knee or hip replacement, largely for osteoarthritis, at St. Clare's Mercy Hospital and the Health Science Centre General Hospital in St. John's, Newfoundland and Labrador, Canada. It collects blood before surgery and follows the patients up after it, to identify genetic, epigenetic and biochemical markers for osteoarthritis.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29494586") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31743460") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40608839") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:29494586") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC5849325/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "knee OA patients were selected from the Newfoundland Osteoarthritis Study (NFOAS) initiated in 2011 [26].") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002140> "A study initiated in 2011 that consecutively recruited, until 2017, patients undergoing total knee or hip replacement, largely for osteoarthritis, at St. Clare's Mercy Hospital and the Health Science Centre General Hospital in St. John's, Newfoundland and Labrador, Canada. It collects blood before surgery and follows the patients up after it, to identify genetic, epigenetic and biochemical markers for osteoarthritis.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29494586") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31743460") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40608839") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:31743460") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A31743460+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "TJR patients were recruited and followed-up at least 1-year post-surgery; TJR outcomes were assessed by Western Ontario and McMaster Universities Osteoarthritis Index (WOMAC) pain and function subscales.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002140> "A study initiated in 2011 that consecutively recruited, until 2017, patients undergoing total knee or hip replacement, largely for osteoarthritis, at St. Clare's Mercy Hospital and the Health Science Centre General Hospital in St. John's, Newfoundland and Labrador, Canada. It collects blood before surgery and follows the patients up after it, to identify genetic, epigenetic and biochemical markers for osteoarthritis.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29494586") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31743460") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40608839") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:31743460") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A31743460+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Targeted metabolomic profiling was performed on plasma samples collected pre-surgery and pairwise metabolite ratios, as proxies for enzymatic reactions, were calculated.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002140> "A study initiated in 2011 that consecutively recruited, until 2017, patients undergoing total knee or hip replacement, largely for osteoarthritis, at St. Clare's Mercy Hospital and the Health Science Centre General Hospital in St. John's, Newfoundland and Labrador, Canada. It collects blood before surgery and follows the patients up after it, to identify genetic, epigenetic and biochemical markers for osteoarthritis.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29494586") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31743460") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40608839") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:40608839") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12225861/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Patients were recruited consecutively.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002140> "A study initiated in 2011 that consecutively recruited, until 2017, patients undergoing total knee or hip replacement, largely for osteoarthritis, at St. Clare's Mercy Hospital and the Health Science Centre General Hospital in St. John's, Newfoundland and Labrador, Canada. It collects blood before surgery and follows the patients up after it, to identify genetic, epigenetic and biochemical markers for osteoarthritis.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29494586") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31743460") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:40608839") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:40608839") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12225861/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The study participants were derived from the Newfoundland Osteoarthritis Study (NFOAS) which recruited 1086 patients aged at least 20 years old who underwent total knee or hip arthroplasty largely due to osteoarthritis (OA) with a small number of patients due to other joint diseases between 30/11/2011 and 05/02/2017") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002140> "A study initiated in 2011 that consecutively recruited, until 2017, patients undergoing total knee or hip replacement, largely for osteoarthritis, at St. Clare's Mercy Hospital and the Health Science Centre General Hospital in St. John's, Newfoundland and Labrador, Canada. It collects blood before surgery and follows the patients up after it, to identify genetic, epigenetic and biochemical markers for osteoarthritis.")

