AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:27145994") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:41851747") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:27145994") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4858728/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "All study subjects were Han Chinese population.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002162> "A case-control sample of Han Chinese adults assembled by Nanjing Medical University in Nanjing, China, for genome-wide association studies of colorectal cancer, whose cases are patients with colorectal cancer recruited at the Cancer Center of Nanjing Medical University from September 2010 and whose cancer-free controls come from the same districts of Nanjing.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:27145994") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:41851747") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:27145994") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4858728/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "In the first GWAS stage, 1,049 colorectal cancer cases were enrolled from the Cancer Center of Nanjing Medical University and 1,315 controls were from the same districts of Nanjing beginning in September 2010 (Nanjing-1).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002162> "A case-control sample of Han Chinese adults assembled by Nanjing Medical University in Nanjing, China, for genome-wide association studies of colorectal cancer, whose cases are patients with colorectal cancer recruited at the Cancer Center of Nanjing Medical University from September 2010 and whose cancer-free controls come from the same districts of Nanjing.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:27145994") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:41851747") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:41851747") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13123215/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "In Nanjing GWAS, the CRC cases were recruited from the Cancer Center of Nanjing Medical University, and the cancer-free controls were from the same districts of Nanjing.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002162> "A case-control sample of Han Chinese adults assembled by Nanjing Medical University in Nanjing, China, for genome-wide association studies of colorectal cancer, whose cases are patients with colorectal cancer recruited at the Cancer Center of Nanjing Medical University from September 2010 and whose cancer-free controls come from the same districts of Nanjing.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:27145994") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:41851747") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:41851747") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC13123215/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The GWAS summary statistics from the Wuhan CRC GWAS and Nanjing CRC GWAS used for PRS construction have also been deposited in the Science Data Bank and are available at: https://cstr.cn/31253.11.sciencedb.28736 and https://cstr.cn/31253.11.sciencedb.28742.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002162> "A case-control sample of Han Chinese adults assembled by Nanjing Medical University in Nanjing, China, for genome-wide association studies of colorectal cancer, whose cases are patients with colorectal cancer recruited at the Cancer Center of Nanjing Medical University from September 2010 and whose cancer-free controls come from the same districts of Nanjing.")

