AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35460926") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35820405") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://clinicaltrials.gov/api/v2/studies/NCT04839796") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:35460926") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10267957/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "In this cohort study, we recruited independent volunteer samples rather than family-based samples.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002189> "A prospective community-based cohort on disease prevention and health promotion, run by the Community Medicine Research Center of Chang Gung Memorial Hospital in Keelung since 2013, that enrols volunteers aged 20 or over living in Keelung City and New Taipei City in northeastern Taiwan through community health outreach sessions with a health examination, questionnaires and biological sampling, and follows them up.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35460926") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35820405") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://clinicaltrials.gov/api/v2/studies/NCT04839796") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:35460926") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10267957/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "We analyzed the data of a community-based cohort study that was conducted from August 2013 to March 2019 in Taiwan (Northeastern Taiwan Community Medicine Research Cohort (NTCMRC); ClinicalTrials.gov Identifier: NCT04839796) [9].") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002189> "A prospective community-based cohort on disease prevention and health promotion, run by the Community Medicine Research Center of Chang Gung Memorial Hospital in Keelung since 2013, that enrols volunteers aged 20 or over living in Keelung City and New Taipei City in northeastern Taiwan through community health outreach sessions with a health examination, questionnaires and biological sampling, and follows them up.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35460926") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35820405") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://clinicaltrials.gov/api/v2/studies/NCT04839796") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:35820405") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9677874/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The Northeastern Taiwan Community Medicine Research Cohort (NTCMRC; ClinicalTrials.gov identifier NCT04839796) was a community cohort study launched in 2012 by the Community Medicine Research Center of Chang Gung Memorial Hospital in Keelung and enrolled adult participants in Northeastern Taiwan.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002189> "A prospective community-based cohort on disease prevention and health promotion, run by the Community Medicine Research Center of Chang Gung Memorial Hospital in Keelung since 2013, that enrols volunteers aged 20 or over living in Keelung City and New Taipei City in northeastern Taiwan through community health outreach sessions with a health examination, questionnaires and biological sampling, and follows them up.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35460926") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35820405") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://clinicaltrials.gov/api/v2/studies/NCT04839796") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:36671416") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9856057/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Methods: A total of 2963 people residing in northern Taiwan were enrolled from August 2013 to May 2018 for an annual assessment of kidney function for five years.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002189> "A prospective community-based cohort on disease prevention and health promotion, run by the Community Medicine Research Center of Chang Gung Memorial Hospital in Keelung since 2013, that enrols volunteers aged 20 or over living in Keelung City and New Taipei City in northeastern Taiwan through community health outreach sessions with a health examination, questionnaires and biological sampling, and follows them up.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35460926") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:35820405") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://clinicaltrials.gov/api/v2/studies/NCT04839796") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:36671416") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC9856057/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The community outreach health screening program was performed to recruit subjects, including physical examinations, blood and urine laboratory tests, and a questionnaire survey.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002189> "A prospective community-based cohort on disease prevention and health promotion, run by the Community Medicine Research Center of Chang Gung Memorial Hospital in Keelung since 2013, that enrols volunteers aged 20 or over living in Keelung City and New Taipei City in northeastern Taiwan through community health outreach sessions with a health examination, questionnaires and biological sampling, and follows them up.")

