AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:17618283") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:17618283") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng2089/MediaObjects/41588_2007_BFng2089_MOESM20_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The population-based Ontario Cancer Registry (OCR) was used to identify and recruit colorectal cancer cases, aged 20-74 and diagnosed between July 1, 1997 and June 30, 2000.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002200> "A population-based familial colorectal cancer registry in Ontario, Canada, one of the sites of the US National Cancer Institute's Colon Cancer Family Registry, which recruited people aged 20 to 74 with colorectal cancer diagnosed from July 1997 to June 2000, identified through the Ontario Cancer Registry, and population controls randomly sampled from Ontario residents and frequency-matched to the cases by sex and five-year age group, who completed family-history, epidemiologic and food questionnaires and gave blood samples.")

