AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23382888") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23527229") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26180744") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23527229") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3603911/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Study design was cross-sectional and population-based.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002201> "A population-based study of a genetic isolate in the Ogliastra region of Sardinia, Italy, in which the inhabitants of ten villages (Baunei, Escalaplano, Loceri, Perdasdefogu, Seui, Seulo, Talana, Triei, Urzulei and Ussassai), invited by public proclamations and letters to every family, took part from 2002 to 2008 in a cross-sectional epidemiological survey with blood sampling and extended pedigrees, to study the genetic and environmental determinants of complex traits.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23382888") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23527229") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26180744") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23527229") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC3603911/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Univariate (heritability), bivariate (genetic and environmental correlation) and sex-limitation analysis of cardiovascular phenotypes were performed on 10 extended pedigrees, using a variance-components model implemented in the software Sequential Oligogenic Linkage Analysis Routines (SOLAR v. 4.2.7) [30], [31].") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002201> "A population-based study of a genetic isolate in the Ogliastra region of Sardinia, Italy, in which the inhabitants of ten villages (Baunei, Escalaplano, Loceri, Perdasdefogu, Seui, Seulo, Talana, Triei, Urzulei and Ussassai), invited by public proclamations and letters to every family, took part from 2002 to 2008 in a cross-sectional epidemiological survey with blood sampling and extended pedigrees, to study the genetic and environmental determinants of complex traits.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23382888") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23527229") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26180744") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:26180744") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4493262/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "A cross-sectional survey was carried out in 10 villages from this area between 2002 and 2008: Baunei, Escalaplano, Loceri, Perdasdefogu, Seui, Seulo, Talana, Triei, Urzulei and Ussassai.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002201> "A population-based study of a genetic isolate in the Ogliastra region of Sardinia, Italy, in which the inhabitants of ten villages (Baunei, Escalaplano, Loceri, Perdasdefogu, Seui, Seulo, Talana, Triei, Urzulei and Ussassai), invited by public proclamations and letters to every family, took part from 2002 to 2008 in a cross-sectional epidemiological survey with blood sampling and extended pedigrees, to study the genetic and environmental determinants of complex traits.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23382888") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23527229") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26180744") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:26180744") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4493262/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "People living in the villages were invited to take part in the study by means of public proclamations and letters sent to each family.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002201> "A population-based study of a genetic isolate in the Ogliastra region of Sardinia, Italy, in which the inhabitants of ten villages (Baunei, Escalaplano, Loceri, Perdasdefogu, Seui, Seulo, Talana, Triei, Urzulei and Ussassai), invited by public proclamations and letters to every family, took part from 2002 to 2008 in a cross-sectional epidemiological survey with blood sampling and extended pedigrees, to study the genetic and environmental determinants of complex traits.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23382888") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23527229") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26180744") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:26180744") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4493262/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Respondents (average participation rate 80%) gave a blood sample, underwent anthropometric measurements, bioelectrical impedance analysis and a standardized interview collecting socio-demographic, lifestyle, medical and drug history data.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002201> "A population-based study of a genetic isolate in the Ogliastra region of Sardinia, Italy, in which the inhabitants of ten villages (Baunei, Escalaplano, Loceri, Perdasdefogu, Seui, Seulo, Talana, Triei, Urzulei and Ussassai), invited by public proclamations and letters to every family, took part from 2002 to 2008 in a cross-sectional epidemiological survey with blood sampling and extended pedigrees, to study the genetic and environmental determinants of complex traits.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23382888") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23527229") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26180744") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:26180744") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC4493262/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Since both genetic and environmental factors are involved in the MetS, we studied this complex phenotype in an isolated population from Sardinia (Ogliastra, Italy).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002201> "A population-based study of a genetic isolate in the Ogliastra region of Sardinia, Italy, in which the inhabitants of ten villages (Baunei, Escalaplano, Loceri, Perdasdefogu, Seui, Seulo, Talana, Triei, Urzulei and Ussassai), invited by public proclamations and letters to every family, took part from 2002 to 2008 in a cross-sectional epidemiological survey with blood sampling and extended pedigrees, to study the genetic and environmental determinants of complex traits.")

