AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:22999729") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:41307346") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:22999729") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A22999729+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The aim of the longitudinal PARTAGE study was to determine the predictive value of blood pressure (BP) and pulse pressure amplification, a marker of arterial function, for overall mortality (primary endpoint) and major cardiovascular (CV) events, in subjects older than 80 years of age living in a nursing home.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002235> "An observational cohort of people aged 80 years or older living in 72 nursing homes in France and Italy, recruited between January 2006 and June 2008 by four French and two Italian university hospital centres and followed for two years, to determine how well blood pressure and arterial stiffness predict mortality and major cardiovascular events in very old institutionalised people.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:22999729") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:41307346") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:41307346") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12746773/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "A total of 72 nursing homes participated in the PARTAGE in France and Italy.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002235> "An observational cohort of people aged 80 years or older living in 72 nursing homes in France and Italy, recruited between January 2006 and June 2008 by four French and two Italian university hospital centres and followed for two years, to determine how well blood pressure and arterial stiffness predict mortality and major cardiovascular events in very old institutionalised people.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:22999729") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:41307346") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:41307346") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12746773/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "During a 2-year follow-up, 186 MACE (20.2%) and 90 cases of cardiovascular mortality (9.8%) were accrued.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002235> "An observational cohort of people aged 80 years or older living in 72 nursing homes in France and Italy, recruited between January 2006 and June 2008 by four French and two Italian university hospital centres and followed for two years, to determine how well blood pressure and arterial stiffness predict mortality and major cardiovascular events in very old institutionalised people.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:22999729") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:41307346") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:41307346") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12746773/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Participants were included if they were aged ≥80 years and were living in nursing homes.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002235> "An observational cohort of people aged 80 years or older living in 72 nursing homes in France and Italy, recruited between January 2006 and June 2008 by four French and two Italian university hospital centres and followed for two years, to determine how well blood pressure and arterial stiffness predict mortality and major cardiovascular events in very old institutionalised people.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:22999729") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:41307346") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:41307346") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12746773/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Participants were recruited by 4 French (Nancy, Dijon, Paris, and Toulouse) and 2 Italian (Cesena and Verona) university hospital centers between January 2006 and June 2008.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002235> "An observational cohort of people aged 80 years or older living in 72 nursing homes in France and Italy, recruited between January 2006 and June 2008 by four French and two Italian university hospital centres and followed for two years, to determine how well blood pressure and arterial stiffness predict mortality and major cardiovascular events in very old institutionalised people.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:22999729") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:41307346") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:41307346") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC12746773/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The PARTAGE is an observational cohort study of 1130 individuals aged 80 years or older [6,18].") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002235> "An observational cohort of people aged 80 years or older living in 72 nursing homes in France and Italy, recruited between January 2006 and June 2008 by four French and two Italian university hospital centres and followed for two years, to determine how well blood pressure and arterial stiffness predict mortality and major cardiovascular events in very old institutionalised people.")

