AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32857771") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:32857771") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7454981/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The controls were randomly selected from residents in the same geographical regions as the cases, and registered in the databases of family medicine clinics who did not have personal history of UADT cancers, nor any type of cancer at the time of recruitment.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002267> "A hospital-based case–control study of lung and head and neck cancers conducted from 2008 in the Greater Toronto Area, Canada, at Mount Sinai Hospital (Sinai Health System) and Princess Margaret Cancer Centre, in which histologically confirmed cases seen at the hospitals' clinics and controls selected at random from family medicine clinic databases, frequency-matched on age and sex, were interviewed with a standard questionnaire on lifestyle, occupational, medical and family history.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32857771") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3892/MediaObjects/41588_2017_BFng3892_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:32857771") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC7454981/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The study questionnaire consisted of a list of the individual’s lifestyle factors (such as alcohol and tobacco consumption, etc.) and environmental factors (such as asbestos exposure, second hand smoke exposure, etc.), as well as personal medical and family history of cancer (S1 File).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002267> "A hospital-based case–control study of lung and head and neck cancers conducted from 2008 in the Greater Toronto Area, Canada, at Mount Sinai Hospital (Sinai Health System) and Princess Margaret Cancer Centre, in which histologically confirmed cases seen at the hospitals' clinics and controls selected at random from family medicine clinic databases, frequency-matched on age and sex, were interviewed with a standard questionnaire on lifestyle, occupational, medical and family history.")
