AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:17697367") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20453838") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-10") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "GPT-6 (OpenAI Codex), 2026-10") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:17697367") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC1995215/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The primary aim of the POSH study is to establish whether genetic status influences the prognosis of primary breast cancer independently of known prognostic factors.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002271> "A prospective cohort of women in the United Kingdom diagnosed with a first primary breast cancer at age 40 or younger, recruited between 2001 and January 2008 (with an additional category of BRCA1 or BRCA2 carriers diagnosed at 41 to 50), with family history, epidemiological and clinical data and blood collected and annual follow-up, to establish whether genetic status influences breast cancer prognosis independently of known prognostic factors.")
