# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002274> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002274>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26387087") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3094/MediaObjects/41588_2014_BFng3094_MOESM58_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3094/MediaObjects/41588_2014_BFng3094_MOESM58_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "SUN study represents a cohort of 311 men with confirmed prostate cancer who presented to two district hospitals (Royal Surrey County Hospital and Frimley Park Hospital) between February 2009 and March 2011 and 242 healthy volunteers with normal PSA.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002274> "A hospital-based case–control study of prostate cancer in Surrey, United Kingdom, run with the University of Surrey, in which men with confirmed prostate cancer who presented to two district hospitals (Royal Surrey County Hospital and Frimley Park Hospital) between February 2009 and March 2011 and healthy volunteers with normal PSA gave DNA samples, contributed to the PRACTICAL consortium's iCOGS genotyping.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26387087") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3094/MediaObjects/41588_2014_BFng3094_MOESM58_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3094/MediaObjects/41588_2014_BFng3094_MOESM58_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The DNA samples were analysed for 257 patients and 176 healthy volunteers.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002274> "A hospital-based case–control study of prostate cancer in Surrey, United Kingdom, run with the University of Surrey, in which men with confirmed prostate cancer who presented to two district hospitals (Royal Surrey County Hospital and Frimley Park Hospital) between February 2009 and March 2011 and healthy volunteers with normal PSA gave DNA samples, contributed to the PRACTICAL consortium's iCOGS genotyping.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26387087") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.3094/MediaObjects/41588_2014_BFng3094_MOESM58_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-020-00748-0/MediaObjects/41588_2020_748_MOESM3_ESM.xlsx") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Prostate Project Foundation - Postgraduate Medical School, Surrey | PPF-UNIS | PRACTICAL iCOGS | European | 257 | 197 | 257 | 176 | Individual | Case-control") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002274> "A hospital-based case–control study of prostate cancer in Surrey, United Kingdom, run with the University of Surrey, in which men with confirmed prostate cancer who presented to two district hospitals (Royal Surrey County Hospital and Frimley Park Hospital) between February 2009 and March 2011 and healthy volunteers with normal PSA gave DNA samples, contributed to the PRACTICAL consortium's iCOGS genotyping.")

