AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31537649") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://cdn-links.lww.com/permalink/jsn/c/jsn_30_10_2022_12_07_salem_2019030218_sdc1.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://cdn-links.lww.com/permalink/jsn/c/jsn_30_10_2022_12_07_salem_2019030218_sdc1.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Patients have been studied in a cross-sectional manner in two centers in Bucharest and one in Craiova between 2010 and 2012.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002328> "A cross-sectional study of diabetic kidney disease in patients with type 1 diabetes, begun in 2010 in Romania as the pilot study of the International Diabetic Nephropathy Consortium (InterDiane, built on the FinnDiane protocol), which examined patients at two centres in Bucharest and one in Craiova between 2010 and 2012, assessing renal status from urinary albumin excretion.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31537649") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://cdn-links.lww.com/permalink/jsn/c/jsn_30_10_2022_12_07_salem_2019030218_sdc1.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://cdn-links.lww.com/permalink/jsn/c/jsn_30_10_2022_12_07_salem_2019030218_sdc1.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Renal status was classified based on the urinary albumin excretion rate (AER) in at least two out of three consecutive urine collections") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002328> "A cross-sectional study of diabetic kidney disease in patients with type 1 diabetes, begun in 2010 in Romania as the pilot study of the International Diabetic Nephropathy Consortium (InterDiane, built on the FinnDiane protocol), which examined patients at two centres in Bucharest and one in Craiova between 2010 and 2012, assessing renal status from urinary albumin excretion.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31537649") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://cdn-links.lww.com/permalink/jsn/c/jsn_30_10_2022_12_07_salem_2019030218_sdc1.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://cdn-links.lww.com/permalink/jsn/c/jsn_30_10_2022_12_07_salem_2019030218_sdc1.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The International Diabetic Nephropathy Consortium (InterDiane) was initiated in 2010 based on the protocol of the FinnDiane Study.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002328> "A cross-sectional study of diabetic kidney disease in patients with type 1 diabetes, begun in 2010 in Romania as the pilot study of the International Diabetic Nephropathy Consortium (InterDiane, built on the FinnDiane protocol), which examined patients at two centres in Bucharest and one in Craiova between 2010 and 2012, assessing renal status from urinary albumin excretion.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31537649") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://cdn-links.lww.com/permalink/jsn/c/jsn_30_10_2022_12_07_salem_2019030218_sdc1.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://cdn-links.lww.com/permalink/jsn/c/jsn_30_10_2022_12_07_salem_2019030218_sdc1.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The Romanian Diabetic Nephropathy Study (RomDiane) was initiated in 2010 in Romania as the pilot study of the InterDiane Consortium.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002328> "A cross-sectional study of diabetic kidney disease in patients with type 1 diabetes, begun in 2010 in Romania as the pilot study of the International Diabetic Nephropathy Consortium (InterDiane, built on the FinnDiane protocol), which examined patients at two centres in Bucharest and one in Craiova between 2010 and 2012, assessing renal status from urinary albumin excretion.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:31537649") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://cdn-links.lww.com/permalink/jsn/c/jsn_30_10_2022_12_07_salem_2019030218_sdc1.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://cdn-links.lww.com/permalink/jsn/c/jsn_30_10_2022_12_07_salem_2019030218_sdc1.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The aim of the study is to identify risk factors for diabetic nephropathy and other chronic complications in patients with T1D.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002328> "A cross-sectional study of diabetic kidney disease in patients with type 1 diabetes, begun in 2010 in Romania as the pilot study of the International Diabetic Nephropathy Consortium (InterDiane, built on the FinnDiane protocol), which examined patients at two centres in Bucharest and one in Craiova between 2010 and 2012, assessing renal status from urinary albumin excretion.")

