AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23339562") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:36688720") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:7942759") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:8072035") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:8072035") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A8072035+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "From the Ontario Cancer Registry, all histologically confirmed, primary malignant or borderline malignant epithelial ovarian tumors first diagnosed from November 1989 through October 1992 among study-area residents aged 35-79 years were determined.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002400> "A population-based case–control study of epithelial ovarian cancer in metropolitan Toronto and nearby areas of southern Ontario, Canada, which from 1989 to 1992 interviewed women aged 35–79 with newly diagnosed, histologically confirmed malignant or borderline epithelial ovarian tumours, identified through the Ontario Cancer Registry, and randomly selected population controls frequency-matched to them on age, about their reproductive history and diet. It is one of the case–control studies of the Ovarian Cancer Association Consortium.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23339562") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:36688720") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:7942759") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:8072035") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:8072035") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A8072035+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "In total, 631 eligible case subjects were identified, of whom 450 (71.3%) were interviewed concerning reproduction and diet; 564 randomly selected population control subjects were similarly interviewed.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002400> "A population-based case–control study of epithelial ovarian cancer in metropolitan Toronto and nearby areas of southern Ontario, Canada, which from 1989 to 1992 interviewed women aged 35–79 with newly diagnosed, histologically confirmed malignant or borderline epithelial ovarian tumours, identified through the Ontario Cancer Registry, and randomly selected population controls frequency-matched to them on age, about their reproductive history and diet. It is one of the case–control studies of the Ovarian Cancer Association Consortium.")

