AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:33623038") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-018-0142-8/MediaObjects/41588_2018_142_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23535732") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2560/MediaObjects/41588_2013_BFng2560_MOESM4_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Of these, 2960 unselected cases and 165 controls (PSA < 4 µg/ml) were collected in Tampere, Finland and all are of Finnish origin.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002435> "A population-based prostate cancer case–control study in Finland, run from Tampere, whose cases were identified through linkage to the Finnish Cancer Registry, patient records and the Finnish arm of the European Randomized Study of Screening for Prostate Cancer (ERSPC), and whose controls are ERSPC cohort participants without a cancer diagnosis; it contributes to the PRACTICAL consortium.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:33623038") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41588-018-0142-8/MediaObjects/41588_2018_142_MOESM1_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23535732") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.2560/MediaObjects/41588_2013_BFng2560_MOESM4_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The other unselected set of samples were 5522 samples collected in the Finnish arm of The European Randomized Study of Screening for Prostate Cancer, which was initiated in the early 1990s to evaluate the effect of screening with prostate-specific–antigen (PSA) testing on death rates from prostate cancer.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002435> "A population-based prostate cancer case–control study in Finland, run from Tampere, whose cases were identified through linkage to the Finnish Cancer Registry, patient records and the Finnish arm of the European Randomized Study of Screening for Prostate Cancer (ERSPC), and whose controls are ERSPC cohort participants without a cancer diagnosis; it contributes to the PRACTICAL consortium.")
