AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23839018") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28604730") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23839018") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC3810840") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Lee Moffitt Cancer Center and Research Institute, 12902 Magnolia Drive, MRC-CANCONT, Tampa, FL 33612, USA") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002458> "A hospital-based, case-only study of the molecular epidemiology of lung cancer survival at the H. Lee Moffitt Cancer Center in Tampa, Florida, United States, whose participants are lung cancer patients recruited from Moffitt's Thoracic Oncology Clinic between April 2006 and August 2010 under the centre's Total Cancer Care protocol, which collects self-reported, medical record and cancer registry data and blood samples.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23839018") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28604730") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23839018") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC3810840") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Moffitt’s Cancer Registry abstracts information from patient electronic medical records on demographics, history of smoking, stage, histology and treatment.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002458> "A hospital-based, case-only study of the molecular epidemiology of lung cancer survival at the H. Lee Moffitt Cancer Center in Tampa, Florida, United States, whose participants are lung cancer patients recruited from Moffitt's Thoracic Oncology Clinic between April 2006 and August 2010 under the centre's Total Cancer Care protocol, which collects self-reported, medical record and cancer registry data and blood samples.")
