AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:22509262") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28128285") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6180013/fullTextXML") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:30305673") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6180013/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "TVS whole blood and monocyte fractions were collected and used for genome-wide analysis of gene expression during 2008.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002473> "A study of atherosclerosis at Tampere University Hospital, Finland, that collected arterial tissue from patients undergoing open vascular surgery (carotid or femoral endarterectomy, or aortic bypass, for occlusive atherosclerosis), with internal thoracic artery samples from coronary bypass patients as controls, and, in a second arm collected in 2008, whole blood and monocyte samples from patients with angiographically verified coronary artery disease and angiographically normal controls drawn from the patients given an exercise test at the hospital, for gene-expression and genetic studies.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:22509262") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28128285") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6180013/fullTextXML") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:30305673") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6180013/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The left internal thoracic artery (LITA) samples, obtained during coronary artery bypass surgery, served as controls.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002473> "A study of atherosclerosis at Tampere University Hospital, Finland, that collected arterial tissue from patients undergoing open vascular surgery (carotid or femoral endarterectomy, or aortic bypass, for occlusive atherosclerosis), with internal thoracic artery samples from coronary bypass patients as controls, and, in a second arm collected in 2008, whole blood and monocyte samples from patients with angiographically verified coronary artery disease and angiographically normal controls drawn from the patients given an exercise test at the hospital, for gene-expression and genetic studies.")
