AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:19648919") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:28346442") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32665703") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:33597508") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:33597508") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fs41467-020-20496-3/MediaObjects/41467_2020_20496_MOESM5_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "CIMBA DACC approval is required to access data from the BCFR-ON, CONSIT TEAM, DKFZ, EMBRACE, FPGMX, GC-HBOC, GEMO, G-FAST, HEBCS, HEBON, IHCC, INHERIT, IOVHBOCS, IPOBCS, MCGILL, MODSQUAD, NAROD, OCGN, OUH and UKGRFOCR studies (Supplementary Table 2).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002507> "The combined contribution to the Consortium of Investigators of Modifiers of BRCA1/2 (CIMBA) of two registries of families with ovarian cancer, the UK Familial Ovarian Cancer Register and the Gilda Radner Familial Ovarian Cancer Registry of Buffalo, New York, providing women carrying BRCA1 or BRCA2 mutations from registered families in the United Kingdom and the United States.")

