AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC3277315") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.723/MediaObjects/41588_2011_BFng723_MOESM3_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.723/MediaObjects/41588_2011_BFng723_MOESM3_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Additionally, African American residents in Detroit diagnosed through January 31, 2007 were eligible.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002529> "A population-based case-control study of renal cell carcinoma run by the US National Cancer Institute in the Chicago (Cook County) and Detroit (Wayne, Macomb and Oakland counties) metropolitan areas, chosen for their high proportion of African American residents. Cases were residents aged 20 to 79 newly diagnosed with histologically confirmed renal cell carcinoma between 2002 and 2007; controls were drawn from motor vehicle and Medicare records and frequency-matched to the cases by age, race and sex, and participants were interviewed about their medical history, tobacco use, occupation, diet, family history of cancer and other factors.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC3277315") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.723/MediaObjects/41588_2011_BFng723_MOESM3_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.723/MediaObjects/41588_2011_BFng723_MOESM3_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Control subjects aged 30 to 64 years were selected randomly from Department of Motor Vehicle (DMV) records in each state, and controls aged 65 to 79 years were selected from Medicare beneficiary records in the study area.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002529> "A population-based case-control study of renal cell carcinoma run by the US National Cancer Institute in the Chicago (Cook County) and Detroit (Wayne, Macomb and Oakland counties) metropolitan areas, chosen for their high proportion of African American residents. Cases were residents aged 20 to 79 newly diagnosed with histologically confirmed renal cell carcinoma between 2002 and 2007; controls were drawn from motor vehicle and Medicare records and frequency-matched to the cases by age, race and sex, and participants were interviewed about their medical history, tobacco use, occupation, diet, family history of cancer and other factors.")
