AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC3277315") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.723/MediaObjects/41588_2011_BFng723_MOESM3_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.723/MediaObjects/41588_2011_BFng723_MOESM3_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The CAPI obtained information on demographics, medical history, use of medications, use of tobacco products, weight fluctuation, physical activity, reproductive factors, occupational history, family history of cancer and dietary factors.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002529> "A population-based case-control study of renal cell carcinoma run by the US National Cancer Institute in the Chicago (Cook County) and Detroit (Wayne, Macomb and Oakland counties) metropolitan areas, chosen for their high proportion of African American residents. Cases were residents aged 20 to 79 newly diagnosed with histologically confirmed renal cell carcinoma between 2002 and 2007; controls were drawn from motor vehicle and Medicare records and frequency-matched to the cases by age, race and sex, and participants were interviewed about their medical history, tobacco use, occupation, diet, family history of cancer and other factors.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://europepmc.org/api/getPdf?pmcid=PMC3277315") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.723/MediaObjects/41588_2011_BFng723_MOESM3_ESM.pdf") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://media.springernature.com/original/springer-static/esm/art%3A10.1038%2Fng.723/MediaObjects/41588_2011_BFng723_MOESM3_ESM.pdf") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The case series included residents between the ages of 20 and 79 years with histologically confirmed RCC (ICD- O-2 C64.9) diagnosed between February 1, 2002 and July 31, 2006 in Detroit, and between January 1, 2003 and December 31, 2003 in Chicago.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002529> "A population-based case-control study of renal cell carcinoma run by the US National Cancer Institute in the Chicago (Cook County) and Detroit (Wayne, Macomb and Oakland counties) metropolitan areas, chosen for their high proportion of African American residents. Cases were residents aged 20 to 79 newly diagnosed with histologically confirmed renal cell carcinoma between 2002 and 2007; controls were drawn from motor vehicle and Medicare records and frequency-matched to the cases by age, race and sex, and participants were interviewed about their medical history, tobacco use, occupation, diet, family history of cancer and other factors.")
