AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:20522523") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:22911860") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:26401513") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:29379882") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:36510334") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:38938199") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:20522523") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC2892941/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Finnish control data from the Vantaa85+ study were received in Beadstudio files and processed using the same protocol.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002538> "A population-based study of the oldest old in Finland that includes all people aged 85 years or over who were living in the city of Vantaa, in southern Finland, on 1 April 1991, whose dementia status was assessed at baseline and at three follow-ups in 1994–99 and who underwent general and neuropathological autopsy whenever possible; its genotyped participants have been used in genetic studies of Alzheimer disease and other neuropathology of very old age and as Finnish controls in genome-wide association studies.")
