# Individual: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002540> (<http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002540>)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:15757960") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32158272") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:15757960") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC555873/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "In 1994 we randomised all men born during 1921-9 who lived in Viborg County, Denmark.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002540> "A single-centre randomised controlled trial of screening for abdominal aortic aneurysm in Viborg County, Denmark, which randomised all men born in 1921–29 who lived in the county in 1994, and those who turned 65 in 1995–98, either to an invitation to abdominal ultrasound screening or to a control group; men found to have an aneurysm of 30–49 mm were offered annual surveillance.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:15757960") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32158272") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:15757960") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC555873/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "In 1995-8 we randomised all those who became 65.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002540> "A single-centre randomised controlled trial of screening for abdominal aortic aneurysm in Viborg County, Denmark, which randomised all men born in 1921–29 who lived in the county in 1994, and those who turned 65 in 1995–98, either to an invitation to abdominal ultrasound screening or to a control group; men found to have an aneurysm of 30–49 mm were offered annual surveillance.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:15757960") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32158272") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:15757960") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC555873/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Men were randomised to the intervention group (screening by abdominal ultrasonography) or control group.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002540> "A single-centre randomised controlled trial of screening for abdominal aortic aneurysm in Viborg County, Denmark, which randomised all men born in 1921–29 who lived in the county in 1994, and those who turned 65 in 1995–98, either to an invitation to abdominal ultrasound screening or to a control group; men found to have an aneurysm of 30–49 mm were offered annual surveillance.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:15757960") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32158272") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:15757960") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC555873/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Single centre randomised controlled trial.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002540> "A single-centre randomised controlled trial of screening for abdominal aortic aneurysm in Viborg County, Denmark, which randomised all men born in 1921–29 who lived in the county in 1994, and those who turned 65 in 1995–98, either to an invitation to abdominal ultrasound screening or to a control group; men found to have an aneurysm of 30–49 mm were offered annual surveillance.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:15757960") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:32158272") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:32158272") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC6986168/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "In the Viborg and VIVA trials, people with an aortic diameter between 30–49 mm were offered annual surveillance while people with an aortic diameter ≥50 mm were referred to CT scan and assessment of indication for elective surgery.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002540> "A single-centre randomised controlled trial of screening for abdominal aortic aneurysm in Viborg County, Denmark, which randomised all men born in 1921–29 who lived in the county in 1994, and those who turned 65 in 1995–98, either to an invitation to abdominal ultrasound screening or to a control group; men found to have an aneurysm of 30–49 mm were offered annual surveillance.")

