AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:18701435") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21852243") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:18701435") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC2722862/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Controls were frequency matched to cases on age/race and recruited from the clinic population receiving routine mammography at the Breast Screening and Diagnostic Center.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002563> "A hospital-based breast cancer case-control study at Wake Forest University Health Sciences (Winston-Salem, North Carolina, United States) that from November 1998 enrolled women newly diagnosed with breast cancer, before any therapy, at the Wake Forest University Breast Care Center, and as controls, frequency-matched to cases on age and race, women with normal mammograms and no history of cancer from those attending routine mammography at its Breast Screening and Diagnostic Center; its African-American participants, recruited up to December 2008, were contributed to the African American Breast Cancer Consortium.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:18701435") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:21852243") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:18701435") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC2722862/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Eligibility criteria for controls included normal mammography results and no prior cancer history.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002563> "A hospital-based breast cancer case-control study at Wake Forest University Health Sciences (Winston-Salem, North Carolina, United States) that from November 1998 enrolled women newly diagnosed with breast cancer, before any therapy, at the Wake Forest University Breast Care Center, and as controls, frequency-matched to cases on age and race, women with normal mammograms and no history of cancer from those attending routine mammography at its Breast Screening and Diagnostic Center; its African-American participants, recruited up to December 2008, were contributed to the African American Breast Cancer Consortium.")
