AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:12721875") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:15685490") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23041239") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:36786861") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:36786861") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/PMC10130117/fullTextXML") Annotation(rdfs:comment "We recruited in a completely anonymized fashion consecutive consenting ischemic stroke patients from hospitals in northwest Germany through the regional Westphalian Stroke Register and from the University Hospital of Greifswald in northeast Germany.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002581> "A regional hospital-based register of patients admitted with acute stroke to cooperating hospitals in Westphalia, north-west Germany, with departments of neurology, internal medicine and geriatric medicine taking part, which records a standardised data set of sociodemographic and clinical characteristics, diagnostic and treatment procedures, complications and status at discharge; its case ascertainment was part of the German Competence Net Stroke, and consecutive consenting ischaemic stroke patients recruited through it have been used in genetic studies of stroke.")

