AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:19839053") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23403126") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "GPT-6 (OpenAI), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:19839053") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A19839053+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Aus-ALL was a national, population-based, multicenter case-control study that prospectively recruited 416 cases and 1,361 controls between 2003 and 2007.") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002712> "A national, population-based multicentre case-control study in Australia that recruited children younger than 15 years with newly diagnosed acute lymphoblastic leukemia and population controls during 2003–2007. Cases were recruited through hospitals and controls through random-digit dialing, with questionnaire information and biospecimens from children and parents used to investigate environmental and genetic causes, including maternal folate supplementation and gene–environment interactions.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:19839053") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23403126") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "GPT-6 (OpenAI), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:19839053") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://www.ebi.ac.uk/europepmc/webservices/rest/search?query=EXT_ID%3A19839053+AND+SRC%3AMED&format=json&resultType=core") Annotation(rdfs:comment "The Australian Study of Causes of Acute Lymphoblastic Leukemia in Children (Aus-ALL) was designed to test the hypothesis, raised by a previous Western Australian study, that maternal folic acid supplementation during pregnancy might reduce the risk of childhood acute lymphoblastic leukemia (ALL).") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002712> "A national, population-based multicentre case-control study in Australia that recruited children younger than 15 years with newly diagnosed acute lymphoblastic leukemia and population controls during 2003–2007. Cases were recruited through hospitals and controls through random-digit dialing, with questionnaire information and biospecimens from children and parents used to investigate environmental and genetic causes, including maternal folate supplementation and gene–environment interactions.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:19839053") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23403126") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "GPT-6 (OpenAI), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23403126") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3652629/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "2003–2007 Case–control study; Frequency matching Hospitals (nationwide) Age 0–14 yrs; Incident ALL; No previous cancer; Biological mother available and at least one parent speaks English; Resident in Australia RDD Age 0–14 yrs; Biological mother available and at least one parent speaks English; Resident in Australia Questionnaire E, G, GxE") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002712> "A national, population-based multicentre case-control study in Australia that recruited children younger than 15 years with newly diagnosed acute lymphoblastic leukemia and population controls during 2003–2007. Cases were recruited through hospitals and controls through random-digit dialing, with questionnaire information and biospecimens from children and parents used to investigate environmental and genetic causes, including maternal folate supplementation and gene–environment interactions.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:19839053") Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "PMID:23403126") Annotation(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "GPT-6 (OpenAI), 2026-09") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:23403126") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC3652629/") Annotation(rdfs:comment "Australia, Aus-ALL 393 393 349 37 0 1249 Blood; Buccal cells ✓ ✓ ✓ ✓ ✓ ✓") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/coho/COHO_0002712> "A national, population-based multicentre case-control study in Australia that recruited children younger than 15 years with newly diagnosed acute lymphoblastic leukemia and population controls during 2003–2007. Cases were recruited through hospitals and controls through random-digit dialing, with questionnaire information and biospecimens from children and parents used to investigate environmental and genetic causes, including maternal folate supplementation and gene–environment interactions.")

